llāh will love you and forgive you your sins. And Allāh is Forgiving and Merciful.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قُلْ", "translit": "ْlُq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "إِن", "translit": "nِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "كُنتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtnُk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "تُحِبُّونَ", "translit": "َnwُّbِḥُt", "root": "حبب"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "فَٱتَّبِعُونِى", "translit": "àِnwُʿعِbَّtٱَf", "root": "تبع"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "يُحْبِبْكُمُ", "translit": "ُmُkْbِbْḥُy", "root": "حبب"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "ٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "وَيَغْفِرْ", "translit": "ْrِfْغَyَw", "root": "غفر"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "لَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ذُنُوبَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَbwُnُhd", "root": "ذنب"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱَw", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "غَفُورٌ", "translit": "ٌrwُfَغ", "root": "غفر"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "رَّحِيمٌ", "translit": "ٌmyِḥَّr", "root": "رحم"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 32, "text": "قُلْ أَطِيعُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَٱلرَّسُولَۖ فَإِن تَوَلَّوْا۟ فَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَا يُحِبُّ ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ ", "translation": "Say, \"Obey Allāh and the Messenger. But if you turn away - then indeed, Allāh does not like the disbelievers.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قُلْ", "translit": "ْlُq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَطِيعُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُʿعyِṭَaʾ", "root": "طوع"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "وَٱلرَّسُولَ", "translit": "َlwُsَّrlٱَw", "root": "رسل"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "فَإِن", "translit": "nِiʾَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "تَوَلَّوْا۟", "translit": "۟āْwَّlَwَt", "root": "ولي"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "فَإِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "لَا", "translit": "āَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "يُحِبُّ", "translit": "ُّbِḥُy", "root": "حبب"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ", "translit": "َnyِrِfَٰkْlٱ", "root": "كفر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 33, "text": "إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ ٱصْطَفَىٰٓ ءَادَمَ وَنُوحًا وَءَالَ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ وَءَالَ عِمْرَٰنَ عَلَى ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ ", "translation": "Indeed, Allāh chose Adam and Noah and the family of Abraham and the family of ʿImrān over the worlds -", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱصْطَفَىٰٓ", "translit": "ٰٓàَfَṭْṣٱ", "root": "صفو"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ءَادَمَ", "translit": "َmَdāَء", "root": "ادم"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَنُوحًا", "translit": "āًḥwُnَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "وَءَالَ", "translit": "َlāَءَw", "root": "اول"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "إِبْرَٰهِيمَ", "translit": "َmyِhَٰrْbِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "وَءَالَ", "translit": "َlāَءَw", "root": "اول"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "عِمْرَٰنَ", "translit": "َnَٰrْmِʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "عَلَى", "translit": "àَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmَlَٰʿعْlٱ", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 34, "text": "ذُرِّيَّةًۢ بَعْضُهَا مِنۢ بَعْضٍۗ وَٱللَّهُ سَمِيعٌ عَلِيمٌ ", "translation": "Descendants, some of them from others. And Allāh is Hearing and Knowing.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "ذُرِّيَّةًۢ", "translit": "ًۢẗَّyِّrُhd", "root": "ذرر"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "بَعْضُهَا", "translit": "āَhُḍْʿعَb", "root": "بعض"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مِنۢ", "translit": "ۢnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "بَعْضٍ", "translit": "ٍḍْʿعَb", "root": "بعض"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱَw", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "سَمِيعٌ", "translit": "ٌʿعyِmَs", "root": "سمع"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "عَلِيمٌ", "translit": "ٌmyِlَʿع", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 35, "text": "إِذْ قَالَتِ ٱمْرَأَتُ عِمْرَٰنَ رَبِّ إِنِّى نَذَرْتُ لَكَ مَا فِى بَطْنِى مُحَرَّرًا فَتَقَبَّلْ مِنِّىٓۖ إِنَّكَ أَنتَ ٱلسَّمِيعُ ٱلْعَلِيمُ ", "translation": "[Mention, O Muḥammad], when the wife of ʿImrān said, \"My Lord, indeed I have pledged to You what is in my womb, consecrated [for Your service], so accept this from me. Indeed, You are the Hearing, the Knowing.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِذْ", "translit": "ْhdِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "قَالَتِ", "translit": "ِtَlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱمْرَأَتُ", "translit": "ُtَaʾَrْmٱ", "root": "مرا"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "عِمْرَٰنَ", "translit": "َnَٰrْmِʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "رَبِّ", "translit": "ِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "إِنِّى", "translit": "àِّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "نَذَرْتُ", "translit": "ُtْrَhdَn", "root": "نذر"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "لَكَ", "translit": "َkَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "بَطْنِى", "translit": "àِnْṭَb", "root": "بطن"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "مُحَرَّرًا", "translit": "āًrَّrَḥُm", "root": "حرر"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "فَتَقَبَّلْ", "translit": "ْlَّbَqَtَf", "root": "قبل"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "مِنِّىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِّnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "إِنَّكَ", "translit": "َkَّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "أَنتَ", "translit": "َtnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "ٱلسَّمِيعُ", "translit": "ُʿعyِmَّslٱ", "root": "سمع"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "ٱلْعَلِيمُ", "translit": "ُmyِlَʿعْlٱ", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 36, "text": "فَلَمَّا وَضَعَتْهَا قَالَتْ رَبِّ إِنِّى وَضَعْتُهَآ أُنثَىٰ وَٱللَّهُ أَعْلَمُ بِمَا وَضَعَتْ وَلَيْسَ ٱلذَّكَرُ كَٱلْأُنثَىٰۖ وَإِنِّى سَمَّيْتُهَا مَرْيَمَ وَإِنِّىٓ أُعِيذُهَا بِكَ وَذُرِّيَّتَهَا مِنَ ٱلشَّيْطَٰنِ ٱلرَّجِيمِ ", "translation": "But when she delivered her, she said, \"My Lord, I have delivered a female.\" And Allāh was most knowing of what she delivered, and the male is not like the female. \"And I have named her Mary, and I seek refuge for her in You and [for] her descendants from Satan, the expelled [from the mercy of Allāh].\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَلَمَّا", "translit": "āَّmَlَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "وَضَعَتْهَا", "translit": "āَhْtَʿعَḍَw", "root": "وضع"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "قَالَتْ", "translit": "ْtَlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "رَبِّ", "translit": "ِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "إِنِّى", "translit": "àِّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "وَضَعْتُهَآ", "translit": "ٓāَhُtْʿعَḍَw", "root": "وضع"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "أُنثَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَhtnُaʾ", "root": "انث"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱَw", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "أَعْلَمُ", "translit": "ُmَlْʿعَaʾ", "root": "علم"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "بِمَا", "translit": "āَmِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "وَضَعَتْ", "translit": "ْtَʿعَḍَw", "root": "وضع"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "وَلَيْسَ", "translit": "َsْyَlَw", "root": "ليس"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "ٱلذَّكَرُ", "translit": "ُrَkَّhdlٱ", "root": "ذكر"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "كَٱلْأُنثَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَhtnُaʾْlٱَk", "root": "انث"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "وَإِنِّى", "translit": "àِّnِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "سَمَّيْتُهَا", "translit": "āَhُtْyَّmَs", "root": "سمو"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "مَرْيَمَ", "translit": "َmَyْrَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "وَإِنِّىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِّnِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "أُعِيذُهَا", "translit": "āَhُhdyِʿعُaʾ", "root": "عوذ"}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "بِكَ", "translit": "َkِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "وَذُرِّيَّتَهَا", "translit": "āَhَtَّyِّrُhdَw", "root": "ذرر"}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "ٱلشَّيْطَٰنِ", "translit": "ِnَٰṭْyَّhslٱ", "root": "شطن"}, {"id": 24, "arabic": "ٱلرَّجِيمِ", "translit": "ِmyِjgَّrlٱ", "root": "رجم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 37, "text": "فَتَقَبَّلَهَا رَبُّهَا بِقَبُولٍ حَسَنٍ وَأَنۢبَتَهَا نَبَاتًا حَسَنًا وَكَفَّلَهَا زَكَرِيَّاۖ كُلَّمَا دَخَلَ عَلَيْهَا زَكَرِيَّا ٱلْمِحْرَابَ وَجَدَ عِندَهَا رِزْقًاۖ قَالَ يَٰمَرْيَمُ أَنَّىٰ لَكِ هَٰذَاۖ قَالَتْ هُوَ مِنْ عِندِ ٱللَّهِۖ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَرْزُقُ مَن يَشَآءُ بِغَيْرِ حِسَابٍ ", "translation": "So her Lord accepted her with good acceptance and caused her to grow in a good manner and put her in the care of Zechariah. Every time Zechariah entered upon her in the prayer chamber, he found with her provision. He said, \"O Mary, from where is this [coming] to you?\" She said, \"It is from Allāh. Indeed, Allāh provides for whom He wills without account.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَتَقَبَّلَهَا", "translit": "āَhَlَّbَqَtَf", "root": "قبل"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "رَبُّهَا", "translit": "āَhُّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "بِقَبُولٍ", "translit": "ٍlwُbَqِb", "root": "قبل"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "حَسَنٍ", "translit": "ٍnَsَḥ", "root": "حسن"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَأَنۢبَتَهَا", "translit": "āَhَtَbۢnَaʾَw", "root": "نبت"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "نَبَاتًا", "translit": "āًtāَbَn", "root": "نبت"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "حَسَنًا", "translit": "āًnَsَḥ", "root": "حسن"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "وَكَفَّلَهَا", "translit": "āَhَlَّfَkَw", "root": "كفل"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "زَكَرِيَّا", "translit": "āَّyِrَkَz", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "كُلَّمَا", "translit": "āَmَّlُk", "root": "كلل"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "دَخَلَ", "translit": "َlَhkَd", "root": "دخل"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "عَلَيْهَا", "translit": "āَhْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "زَكَرِيَّا", "translit": "āَّyِrَkَz", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "ٱلْمِحْرَابَ", "translit": "َbāَrْḥِmْlٱ", "root": "حرب"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "وَجَدَ", "translit": "َdَjgَw", "root": "وجد"}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "عِندَهَا", "translit": "āَhَdnِʿع", "root": "عند"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "رِزْقًا", "translit": "āًqْzِr", "root": "رزق"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "يَٰمَرْيَمُ", "translit": "ُmَyْrَmَٰy", "root": ""}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "أَنَّىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَّnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "لَكِ", "translit": "ِkَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "هَٰذَا", "translit": "āَhdَٰh", "root": ""}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "قَالَتْ", "translit": "ْtَlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 24, "arabic": "هُوَ", "translit": "َwُh", "root": ""}, {"id": 25, "arabic": "مِنْ", "translit": "ْnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 26, "arabic": "عِندِ", "translit": "ِdnِʿع", "root": "عند"}, {"id": 27, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 28, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 29, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 30, "arabic": "يَرْزُقُ", "translit": "ُqُzْrَy", "root": "رزق"}, {"id": 31, "arabic": "مَن", "translit": "nَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 32, "arabic": "يَشَآءُ", "translit": "ُءٓāَhsَy", "root": "شيا"}, {"id": 33, "arabic": "بِغَيْرِ", "translit": "ِrْyَغِb", "root": "غير"}, {"id": 34, "arabic": "حِسَابٍ", "translit": "ٍbāَsِḥ", "root": "حسب"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 38, "text": "هُنَالِكَ دَعَا زَكَرِيَّا رَبَّهُۥۖ قَالَ رَبِّ هَبْ لِى مِن لَّدُنكَ ذُرِّيَّةً طَيِّبَةًۖ إِنَّكَ سَمِيعُ ٱلدُّعَآءِ ", "translation": "At that, Zechariah called upon his Lord, saying, \"My Lord, grant me from Yourself a good offspring. Indeed, You are the Hearer of supplication.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "هُنَالِكَ", "translit": "َkِlāَnُh", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "دَعَا", "translit": "āَʿعَd", "root": "دعو"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "زَكَرِيَّا", "translit": "āَّyِrَkَz", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "رَبَّهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "رَبِّ", "translit": "ِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "هَبْ", "translit": "ْbَh", "root": "وهب"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "لِى", "translit": "àِl", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "مِن", "translit": "nِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "لَّدُنكَ", "translit": "َknُdَّl", "root": "لدن"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ذُرِّيَّةً", "translit": "ًẗَّyِّrُhd", "root": "ذرر"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "طَيِّبَةً", "translit": "ًẗَbِّyَṭ", "root": "طيب"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "إِنَّكَ", "translit": "َkَّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "سَمِيعُ", "translit": "ُʿعyِmَs", "root": "سمع"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "ٱلدُّعَآءِ", "translit": "ِءٓāَʿعُّdlٱ", "root": "دعو"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 39, "text": "فَنَادَتْهُ ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةُ وَهُوَ قَآئِمٌ يُصَلِّى فِى ٱلْمِحْرَابِ أَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يُبَشِّرُكَ بِيَحْيَىٰ مُصَدِّقًۢا بِكَلِمَةٍ مِّنَ ٱللَّهِ وَسَيِّدًا وَحَصُورًا وَنَبِيًّا مِّنَ ٱلصَّٰلِحِينَ ", "translation": "So the angels called him while he was standing in prayer in the chamber, \"Indeed, Allāh gives you good tidings of John, confirming a word[1] from Allāh and [who will be] honorable, abstaining [from women], and a prophet from among the righteous.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَنَادَتْهُ", "translit": "ُhْtَdāَnَf", "root": "ندي"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةُ", "translit": "ُẗَkِyʾَٰٓlَmْlٱ", "root": "ملك"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَهُوَ", "translit": "َwُhَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "قَآئِمٌ", "translit": "ٌmِyʾٓāَq", "root": "قوم"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "يُصَلِّى", "translit": "àِّlَṣُy", "root": "صلو"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱلْمِحْرَابِ", "translit": "ِbāَrْḥِmْlٱ", "root": "حرب"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "أَنَّ", "translit": "َّnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "يُبَشِّرُكَ", "translit": "َkُrِّhsَbُy", "root": "بشر"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "بِيَحْيَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَyْḥَyِb", "root": "حيي"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "مُصَدِّقًۢا", "translit": "āًۢqِّdَṣُm", "root": "صدق"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "بِكَلِمَةٍ", "translit": "ٍẗَmِlَkِb", "root": "كلم"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "مِّنَ", "translit": "َnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "وَسَيِّدًا", "translit": "āًdِّyَsَw", "root": "سود"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "وَحَصُورًا", "translit": "āًrwُṣَḥَw", "root": "حصر"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "وَنَبِيًّا", "translit": "āًّyِbَnَw", "root": "نبا"}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "مِّنَ", "translit": "َnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "ٱلصَّٰلِحِينَ", "translit": "َnyِḥِlَّٰṣlٱ", "root": "صلح"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 40, "text": "قَالَ رَبِّ أَنَّىٰ يَكُونُ لِى غُلَٰمٌ وَقَدْ بَلَغَنِىَ ٱلْكِبَرُ وَٱمْرَأَتِى عَاقِرٌۖ قَالَ كَذَٰلِكَ ٱللَّهُ يَفْعَلُ مَا يَشَآءُ ", "translation": "He said, \"My Lord, how will I have a boy when I have reached old age and my wife is barren?\" He [the angel] said, \"Such is Allāh; He does what He wills.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "رَبِّ", "translit": "ِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أَنَّىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَّnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "يَكُونُ", "translit": "ُnwُkَy", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "لِى", "translit": "àِl", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "غُلَٰمٌ", "translit": "ٌmَٰlُغ", "root": "غلم"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "وَقَدْ", "translit": "ْdَqَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "بَلَغَنِىَ", "translit": "َàِnَغَlَb", "root": "بلغ"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "ٱلْكِبَرُ", "translit": "ُrَbِkْlٱ", "root": "كبر"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "وَٱمْرَأَتِى", "translit": "àِtَaʾَrْmٱَw", "root": "مرا"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "عَاقِرٌ", "translit": "ٌrِqāَʿع", "root": "عقر"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "كَذَٰلِكَ", "translit": "َkِlَٰhdَk", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "ٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "يَفْعَلُ", "translit": "ُlَʿعْfَy", "root": "فعل"}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "يَشَآءُ", "translit": "ُءٓāَhsَy", "root": "شيا"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 41, "text": "قَالَ رَبِّ ٱجْعَل لِّىٓ ءَايَةًۖ قَالَ ءَايَتُكَ أَلَّا تُكَلِّمَ ٱلنَّاسَ ثَلَٰثَةَ أَيَّامٍ إِلَّا رَمْزًاۗ وَٱذْكُر رَّبَّكَ كَثِيرًا وَسَبِّحْ بِٱلْعَشِىِّ وَٱلْإِبْكَٰرِ ", "translation": "He said, \"My Lord, make for me a sign.\" He said, \"Your sign is that you will not [be able to] speak to the people for three days except by gesture. And remember your Lord much and exalt [Him with praise] in the evening and the morning.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "رَبِّ", "translit": "ِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱجْعَل", "translit": "lَʿعْjgٱ", "root": "جعل"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "لِّىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِّl", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ءَايَةً", "translit": "ًẗَyāَء", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ءَايَتُكَ", "translit": "َkُtَyāَء", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "أَلَّا", "translit": "āَّlَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "تُكَلِّمَ", "translit": "َmِّlَkُt", "root": "كلم"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "ٱلنَّاسَ", "translit": "َsāَّnlٱ", "root": "انس"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ثَلَٰثَةَ", "translit": "َẗَhtَٰlَht", "root": "ثلث"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "أَيَّامٍ", "translit": "ٍmāَّyَaʾ", "root": "يوم"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "رَمْزًا", "translit": "āًzْmَr", "root": "رمز"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "وَٱذْكُر", "translit": "rُkْhdٱَw", "root": "ذكر"}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "رَّبَّكَ", "translit": "َkَّbَّr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "كَثِيرًا", "translit": "āًryِhtَk", "root": "كثر"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "وَسَبِّحْ", "translit": "ْḥِّbَsَw", "root": "سبح"}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "بِٱلْعَشِىِّ", "translit": "ِّàِhsَʿعْlٱِb", "root": "عشو"}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "وَٱلْإِبْكَٰرِ", "translit": "ِrَٰkْbِiʾْlٱَw", "root": "بكر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 42, "text": "وَإِذْ قَالَتِ ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةُ يَٰمَرْيَمُ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ ٱصْطَفَىٰكِ وَطَهَّرَكِ وَٱصْطَفَىٰكِ عَلَىٰ نِسَآءِ ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ ", "translation": "And [mention] when the angels said, \"O Mary, indeed Allāh has chosen you and purified you and chosen you above the women of the worlds.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِذْ", "translit": "ْhdِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "قَالَتِ", "translit": "ِtَlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةُ", "translit": "ُẗَkِyʾَٰٓlَmْlٱ", "root": "ملك"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "يَٰمَرْيَمُ", "translit": "ُmَyْrَmَٰy", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱصْطَفَىٰكِ", "translit": "ِkٰàَfَṭْṣٱ", "root": "صفو"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "وَطَهَّرَكِ", "translit": "ِkَrَّhَṭَw", "root": "طهر"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "وَٱصْطَفَىٰكِ", "translit": "ِkٰàَfَṭْṣٱَw", "root": "صفو"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "عَلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "نِسَآءِ", "translit": "ِءٓāَsِn", "root": "نسو"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmَlَٰʿعْlٱ", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 43, "text": "يَٰمَرْيَمُ ٱقْنُتِى لِرَبِّكِ وَٱسْجُدِى وَٱرْكَعِى مَعَ ٱلرَّٰكِعِينَ ", "translation": "O Mary, be devoutly obedient to your Lord and prostrate and bow with those who bow [in prayer].\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "يَٰمَرْيَمُ", "translit": "ُmَyْrَmَٰy", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱقْنُتِى", "translit": "àِtُnْqٱ", "root": "قنت"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لِرَبِّكِ", "translit": "ِkِّbَrِl", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "وَٱسْجُدِى", "translit": "àِdُjgْsٱَw", "root": "سجد"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَٱرْكَعِى", "translit": "àِʿعَkْrٱَw", "root": "ركع"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "مَعَ", "translit": "َʿعَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱلرَّٰكِعِينَ", "translit": "َnyِʿعِkَّٰrlٱ", "root": "ركع"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 44, "text": "ذَٰلِكَ مِنْ أَنۢبَآءِ ٱلْغَيْبِ نُوحِيهِ إِلَيْكَۚ وَمَا كُنتَ لَدَيْهِمْ إِذْ يُلْقُونَ أَقْلَٰمَهُمْ أَيُّهُمْ يَكْفُلُ مَرْيَمَ وَمَا كُنتَ لَدَيْهِمْ إِذْ يَخْتَصِمُونَ ", "translation": "That is from the news of the unseen which We reveal to you, [O Muḥammad]. And you were not with them when they cast their pens[1] as to which of them should be responsible for Mary. Nor were you with them when they disputed.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translit": "َkِlَٰhd", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مِنْ", "translit": "ْnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أَنۢبَآءِ", "translit": "ِءٓāَbۢnَaʾ", "root": "نبا"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْغَيْبِ", "translit": "ِbْyَغْlٱ", "root": "غيب"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "نُوحِيهِ", "translit": "ِhyِḥwُn", "root": "وحي"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "إِلَيْكَ", "translit": "َkْyَlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "كُنتَ", "translit": "َtnُk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "لَدَيْهِمْ", "translit": "ْmِhْyَdَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "إِذْ", "translit": "ْhdِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "يُلْقُونَ", "translit": "َnwُqْlُy", "root": "لقي"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "أَقْلَٰمَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَmَٰlْqَaʾ", "root": "قلم"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "أَيُّهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhُّyَaʾ", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "يَكْفُلُ", "translit": "ُlُfْkَy", "root": "كفل"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "مَرْيَمَ", "translit": "َmَyْrَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "كُنتَ", "translit": "َtnُk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "لَدَيْهِمْ", "translit": "ْmِhْyَdَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "إِذْ", "translit": "ْhdِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "يَخْتَصِمُونَ", "translit": "َnwُmِṣَtْhkَy", "root": "خصم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 45, "text": "إِذْ قَالَتِ ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةُ يَٰمَرْيَمُ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ يُبَشِّرُكِ بِكَلِمَةٍ مِّنْهُ ٱسْمُهُ ٱلْمَسِيحُ عِيسَى ٱبْنُ مَرْيَمَ وَجِيهًا فِى ٱلدُّنْيَا وَٱلْءَاخِرَةِ وَمِنَ ٱلْمُقَرَّبِينَ ", "translation": "[And mention] when the angels said, \"O Mary, indeed Allāh gives you good tidings of a word[1] from Him, whose name will be the Messiah, Jesus, the son of Mary - distinguished in this world and the Hereafter and among those brought near [to Allāh].", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِذْ", "translit": "ْhdِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "قَالَتِ", "translit": "ِtَlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةُ", "translit": "ُẗَkِyʾَٰٓlَmْlٱ", "root": "ملك"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "يَٰمَرْيَمُ", "translit": "ُmَyْrَmَٰy", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "يُبَشِّرُكِ", "translit": "ِkُrِّhsَbُy", "root": "بشر"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "بِكَلِمَةٍ", "translit": "ٍẗَmِlَkِb", "root": "كلم"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "مِّنْهُ", "translit": "ُhْnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "ٱسْمُهُ", "translit": "ُhُmْsٱ", "root": "سمو"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ٱلْمَسِيحُ", "translit": "ُḥyِsَmْlٱ", "root": "مسح"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "عِيسَى", "translit": "àَsyِʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "ٱبْنُ", "translit": "ُnْbٱ", "root": "بني"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "مَرْيَمَ", "translit": "َmَyْrَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "وَجِيهًا", "translit": "āًhyِjgَw", "root": "وجه"}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "ٱلدُّنْيَا", "translit": "āَyْnُّdlٱ", "root": "دنو"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "وَٱلْءَاخِرَةِ", "translit": "ِẗَrِhkāَءْlٱَw", "root": "اخر"}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "وَمِنَ", "translit": "َnِmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "ٱلْمُقَرَّبِينَ", "translit": "َnyِbَّrَqُmْlٱ", "root": "قرب"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 46, "text": "وَيُكَلِّمُ ٱلنَّاسَ فِى ٱلْمَهْدِ وَكَهْلًا وَمِنَ ٱلصَّٰلِحِينَ ", "translation": "He will speak to the people in the cradle and in maturity and will be of the righteous.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَيُكَلِّمُ", "translit": "ُmِّlَkُyَw", "root": "كلم"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلنَّاسَ", "translit": "َsāَّnlٱ", "root": "انس"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْمَهْدِ", "translit": "ِdْhَmْlٱ", "root": "مهد"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَكَهْلًا", "translit": "āًlْhَkَw", "root": "كهل"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "وَمِنَ", "translit": "َnِmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱلصَّٰلِحِينَ", "translit": "َnyِḥِlَّٰṣlٱ", "root": "صلح"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 47, "text": "قَالَتْ رَبِّ أَنَّىٰ يَكُونُ لِى وَلَدٌ وَلَمْ يَمْسَسْنِى بَشَرٌۖ قَالَ كَذَٰلِكِ ٱللَّهُ يَخْلُقُ مَا يَشَآءُۚ إِذَا قَضَىٰٓ أَمْرًا فَإِنَّمَا يَقُولُ لَهُۥ كُن فَيَكُونُ ", "translation": "She said, \"My Lord, how will I have a child when no man has touched me?\" [The angel] said, \"Such is Allāh; He creates what He wills. When He decrees a matter, He only says to it, 'Be,' and it is.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَتْ", "translit": "ْtَlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "رَبِّ", "translit": "ِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أَنَّىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَّnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "يَكُونُ", "translit": "ُnwُkَy", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "لِى", "translit": "àِl", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "وَلَدٌ", "translit": "ٌdَlَw", "root": "ولد"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "وَلَمْ", "translit": "ْmَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "يَمْسَسْنِى", "translit": "àِnْsَsْmَy", "root": "مسس"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "بَشَرٌ", "translit": "ٌrَhsَb", "root": "بشر"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "كَذَٰلِكِ", "translit": "ِkِlَٰhdَk", "root": ""}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "ٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "يَخْلُقُ", "translit": "ُqُlْhkَy", "root": "خلق"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "يَشَآءُ", "translit": "ُءٓāَhsَy", "root": "شيا"}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "إِذَا", "translit": "āَhdِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "قَضَىٰٓ", "translit": "ٰٓàَḍَq", "root": "قضي"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "أَمْرًا", "translit": "āًrْmَaʾ", "root": "امر"}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "فَإِنَّمَا", "translit": "āَmَّnِiʾَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "يَقُولُ", "translit": "ُlwُqَy", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "لَهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "كُن", "translit": "nُk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "فَيَكُونُ", "translit": "ُnwُkَyَf", "root": "كون"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 48, "text": "وَيُعَلِّمُهُ ٱلْكِتَٰبَ وَٱلْحِكْمَةَ وَٱلتَّوْرَىٰةَ وَٱلْإِنجِيلَ ", "translation": "And He will teach him writing and wisdom[1] and the Torah and the Gospel", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَيُعَلِّمُهُ", "translit": "ُhُmِّlَʿعُyَw", "root": "علم"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلْكِتَٰبَ", "translit": "َbَٰtِkْlٱ", "root": "كتب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَٱلْحِكْمَةَ", "translit": "َẗَmْkِḥْlٱَw", "root": "حكم"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "وَٱلتَّوْرَىٰةَ", "translit": "َẗٰàَrْwَّtlٱَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَٱلْإِنجِيلَ", "translit": "َlyِjgnِiʾْlٱَw", "root": ""}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 49, "text": "وَرَسُولًا إِلَىٰ بَنِىٓ إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ أَنِّى قَدْ جِئْتُكُم بِـَٔايَةٍ مِّن رَّبِّكُمْۖ أَنِّىٓ أَخْلُقُ لَكُم مِّنَ ٱلطِّينِ كَهَيْـَٔةِ ٱلطَّيْرِ فَأَنفُخُ فِيهِ فَيَكُونُ طَيْرًۢا بِإِذْنِ ٱللَّهِۖ وَأُبْرِئُ ٱلْأَكْمَهَ وَٱلْأَبْرَصَ وَأُحْىِ ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ بِإِذْنِ ٱللَّهِۖ وَأُنَبِّئُكُم بِمَا تَأْكُلُونَ وَمَا تَدَّخِرُونَ فِى بُيُوتِكُمْۚ إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَءَايَةً لَّكُمْ إِن كُنتُم مُّؤْمِنِينَ ", "translation": "And [make him] a messenger to the Children of Israel, [who will say], 'Indeed I have come to you with a sign from your Lord in that I design for you from clay [that which is] like the form of a bird, then I breathe into it and it becomes a bird by permission of Allāh. And I cure the blind [from birth] and the leper, and I give life to the dead - by permission of Allāh. And I inform you of what you eat and what you store in your houses. Indeed in that is a sign for you, if you are believers.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَرَسُولًا", "translit": "āًlwُsَrَw", "root": "رسل"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "إِلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "بَنِىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِnَb", "root": "بني"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ", "translit": "َlyِءَٰٓrْsِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "أَنِّى", "translit": "àِّnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "قَدْ", "translit": "ْdَq", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "جِئْتُكُم", "translit": "mُkُtْyʾِjg", "root": "جيا"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "بِـَٔايَةٍ", "translit": "ٍẗَyāَٔـِb", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "مِّن", "translit": "nِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "رَّبِّكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkِّbَّr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "أَنِّىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِّnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "أَخْلُقُ", "translit": "ُqُlْhkَaʾ", "root": "خلق"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "لَكُم", "translit": "mُkَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "مِّنَ", "translit": "َnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "ٱلطِّينِ", "translit": "ِnyِّṭlٱ", "root": "طين"}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "كَهَيْـَٔةِ", "translit": "ِẗَٔـْyَhَk", "root": "هيا"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "ٱلطَّيْرِ", "translit": "ِrْyَّṭlٱ", "root": "طير"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "فَأَنفُخُ", "translit": "ُhkُfnَaʾَf", "root": "نفخ"}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "فِيهِ", "translit": "ِhyِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "فَيَكُونُ", "translit": "ُnwُkَyَf", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "طَيْرًۢا", "translit": "āًۢrْyَṭ", "root": "طير"}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "بِإِذْنِ", "translit": "ِnْhdِiʾِb", "root": "اذن"}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 24, "arabic": "وَأُبْرِئُ", "translit": "ُyʾِrْbُaʾَw", "root": "برا"}, {"id": 25, "arabic": "ٱلْأَكْمَهَ", "translit": "َhَmْkَaʾْlٱ", "root": "كمه"}, {"id": 26, "arabic": "وَٱلْأَبْرَصَ", "translit": "َṣَrْbَaʾْlٱَw", "root": "برص"}, {"id": 27, "arabic": "وَأُحْىِ", "translit": "ِàْḥُaʾَw", "root": "حيي"}, {"id": 28, "arabic": "ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَtْwَmْlٱ", "root": "موت"}, {"id": 29, "arabic": "بِإِذْنِ", "translit": "ِnْhdِiʾِb", "root": "اذن"}, {"id": 30, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 31, "arabic": "وَأُنَبِّئُكُم", "translit": "mُkُyʾِّbَnُaʾَw", "root": "نبا"}, {"id": 32, "arabic": "بِمَا", "translit": "āَmِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 33, "arabic": "تَأْكُلُونَ", "translit": "َnwُlُkْaʾَt", "root": "اكل"}, {"id": 34, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 35, "arabic": "تَدَّخِرُونَ", "translit": "َnwُrِhkَّdَt", "root": "ذخر"}, {"id": 36, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 37, "arabic": "بُيُوتِكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkِtwُyُb", "root": "بيت"}, {"id": 38, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 39, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 40, "arabic": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translit": "َkِlَٰhd", "root": ""}, {"id": 41, "arabic": "لَءَايَةً", "translit": "ًẗَyāَءَl", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 42, "arabic": "لَّكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَّl", "root": ""}, {"id": 43, "arabic": "إِن", "translit": "nِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 44, "arabic": "كُنتُم", "translit": "mُtnُk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 45, "arabic": "مُّؤْمِنِينَ", "translit": "َnyِnِmْwʾُّm", "root": "امن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 50, "text": "وَمُصَدِّقًا لِّمَا بَيْنَ يَدَىَّ مِنَ ٱلتَّوْرَىٰةِ وَلِأُحِلَّ لَكُم بَعْضَ ٱلَّذِى حُرِّمَ عَلَيْكُمْۚ وَجِئْتُكُم بِـَٔايَةٍ مِّن رَّبِّكُمْ فَٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَأَطِيعُونِ ", "translation": "And [I have come] confirming what was before me of the Torah and to make lawful for you some of what was forbidden to you. And I have come to you with a sign from your Lord, so fear Allāh and obey me.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَمُصَدِّقًا", "translit": "āًqِّdَṣُmَw", "root": "صدق"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لِّمَا", "translit": "āَmِّl", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "بَيْنَ", "translit": "َnْyَb", "root": "بين"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "يَدَىَّ", "translit": "َّàَdَy", "root": "يدي"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱلتَّوْرَىٰةِ", "translit": "ِẗٰàَrْwَّtlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "وَلِأُحِلَّ", "translit": "َّlِḥُaʾِlَw", "root": "حلل"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "لَكُم", "translit": "mُkَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "بَعْضَ", "translit": "َḍْʿعَb", "root": "بعض"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "ٱلَّذِى", "translit": "àِhdَّlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "حُرِّمَ", "translit": "َmِّrُḥ", "root": "حرم"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "عَلَيْكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "وَجِئْتُكُم", "translit": "mُkُtْyʾِjgَw", "root": "جيا"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "بِـَٔايَةٍ", "translit": "ٍẗَyāَٔـِb", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "مِّن", "translit": "nِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "رَّبِّكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkِّbَّr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "فَٱتَّقُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُqَّtٱَf", "root": "وقي"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "وَأَطِيعُونِ", "translit": "ِnwُʿعyِṭَaʾَw", "root": "طوع"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 51, "text": "إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ رَبِّى وَرَبُّكُمْ فَٱعْبُدُوهُۗ هَٰذَا صِرَٰطٌ مُّسْتَقِيمٌ ", "translation": "Indeed, Allāh is my Lord and your Lord, so worship Him. That is the straight path.'\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "رَبِّى", "translit": "àِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "وَرَبُّكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkُّbَrَw", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "فَٱعْبُدُوهُ", "translit": "ُhwُdُbْʿعٱَf", "root": "عبد"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "هَٰذَا", "translit": "āَhdَٰh", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "صِرَٰطٌ", "translit": "ٌṭَٰrِṣ", "root": "صرط"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "مُّسْتَقِيمٌ", "translit": "ٌmyِqَtْsُّm", "root": "قوم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 52, "text": "فَلَمَّآ أَحَسَّ عِيسَىٰ مِنْهُمُ ٱلْكُفْرَ قَالَ مَنْ أَنصَارِىٓ إِلَى ٱللَّهِۖ قَالَ ٱلْحَوَارِيُّونَ نَحْنُ أَنصَارُ ٱللَّهِ ءَامَنَّا بِٱللَّهِ وَٱشْهَدْ بِأَنَّا مُسْلِمُونَ ", "translation": "But when Jesus felt [persistence in] disbelief from them, he said, \"Who are my supporters for [the cause of] Allāh?\" The disciples said, \"We are supporters for Allāh. We have believed in Allāh and testify that we are Muslims [submitting to Him].", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَلَمَّآ", "translit": "ٓāَّmَlَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَحَسَّ", "translit": "َّsَḥَaʾ", "root": "حسس"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "عِيسَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَsyِʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مِنْهُمُ", "translit": "ُmُhْnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلْكُفْرَ", "translit": "َrْfُkْlٱ", "root": "كفر"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "مَنْ", "translit": "ْnَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "أَنصَارِىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِrāَṣnَaʾ", "root": "نصر"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "إِلَى", "translit": "àَlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "ٱلْحَوَارِيُّونَ", "translit": "َnwُّyِrāَwَḥْlٱ", "root": "حور"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "نَحْنُ", "translit": "ُnْḥَn", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "أَنصَارُ", "translit": "ُrāَṣnَaʾ", "root": "نصر"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "ءَامَنَّا", "translit": "āَّnَmāَء", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "بِٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱِb", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "وَٱشْهَدْ", "translit": "ْdَhْhsٱَw", "root": "شهد"}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "بِأَنَّا", "translit": "āَّnَaʾِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "مُسْلِمُونَ", "translit": "َnwُmِlْsُm", "root": "سلم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 53, "text": "رَبَّنَآ ءَامَنَّا بِمَآ أَنزَلْتَ وَٱتَّبَعْنَا ٱلرَّسُولَ فَٱكْتُبْنَا مَعَ ٱلشَّٰهِدِينَ ", "translation": "Our Lord, we have believed in what You revealed and have followed the messenger [i.e., Jesus], so register us among the witnesses [to truth].\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "رَبَّنَآ", "translit": "ٓāَnَّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ءَامَنَّا", "translit": "āَّnَmāَء", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "بِمَآ", "translit": "ٓāَmِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَنزَلْتَ", "translit": "َtْlَznَaʾ", "root": "نزل"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَٱتَّبَعْنَا", "translit": "āَnْʿعَbَّtٱَw", "root": "تبع"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱلرَّسُولَ", "translit": "َlwُsَّrlٱ", "root": "رسل"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "فَٱكْتُبْنَا", "translit": "āَnْbُtْkٱَf", "root": "كتب"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "مَعَ", "translit": "َʿعَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "ٱلشَّٰهِدِينَ", "translit": "َnyِdِhَّٰhslٱ", "root": "شهد"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 54, "text": "وَمَكَرُوا۟ وَمَكَرَ ٱللَّهُۖ وَٱللَّهُ خَيْرُ ٱلْمَٰكِرِينَ ", "translation": "And they [i.e., the disbelievers] planned, but Allāh planned. And Allāh is the best of planners.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَمَكَرُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُrَkَmَw", "root": "مكر"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "وَمَكَرَ", "translit": "َrَkَmَw", "root": "مكر"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱَw", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "خَيْرُ", "translit": "ُrْyَhk", "root": "خير"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱلْمَٰكِرِينَ", "translit": "َnyِrِkَٰmْlٱ", "root": "مكر"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 55, "text": "إِذْ قَالَ ٱللَّهُ يَٰعِيسَىٰٓ إِنِّى مُتَوَفِّيكَ وَرَافِعُكَ إِلَىَّ وَمُطَهِّرُكَ مِنَ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ وَجَاعِلُ ٱلَّذِينَ ٱتَّبَعُوكَ فَوْقَ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوٓا۟ إِلَىٰ يَوْمِ ٱلْقِيَٰمَةِۖ ثُمَّ إِلَىَّ مَرْجِعُكُمْ فَأَحْكُمُ بَيْنَكُمْ فِيمَا كُنتُمْ فِيهِ تَخْتَلِفُونَ ", "translation": "[Mention] when Allāh said, \"O Jesus, indeed I will take you and raise you to Myself and purify [i.e., free] you from those who disbelieve and make those who follow you [in submission to Allāh alone] superior to those who disbelieve until the Day of Resurrection. Then to Me is your return, and I will judge between you concerning that in which you used to differ.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِذْ", "translit": "ْhdِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "يَٰعِيسَىٰٓ", "translit": "ٰٓàَsyِʿعَٰy", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "إِنِّى", "translit": "àِّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "مُتَوَفِّيكَ", "translit": "َkyِّfَwَtُm", "root": "وفي"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "وَرَافِعُكَ", "translit": "َkُʿعِfāَrَw", "root": "رفع"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "إِلَىَّ", "translit": "َّàَlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "وَمُطَهِّرُكَ", "translit": "َkُrِّhَṭُmَw", "root": "طهر"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translit": "َnyِhdَّlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "كَفَرُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُrَfَk", "root": "كفر"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "وَجَاعِلُ", "translit": "ُlِʿعāَjgَw", "root": "جعل"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translit": "َnyِhdَّlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "ٱتَّبَعُوكَ", "translit": "َkwُʿعَbَّtٱ", "root": "تبع"}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "فَوْقَ", "translit": "َqْwَf", "root": "فوق"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translit": "َnyِhdَّlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "كَفَرُوٓا۟", "translit": "۟āٓwُrَfَk", "root": "كفر"}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "إِلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "يَوْمِ", "translit": "ِmْwَy", "root": "يوم"}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "ٱلْقِيَٰمَةِ", "translit": "ِẗَmَٰyِqْlٱ", "root": "قوم"}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "ثُمَّ", "translit": "َّmُht", "root": ""}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "إِلَىَّ", "translit": "َّàَlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 24, "arabic": "مَرْجِعُكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkُʿعِjgْrَm", "root": "رجع"}, {"id": 25, "arabic": "فَأَحْكُمُ", "translit": "ُmُkْḥَaʾَf", "root": "حكم"}, {"id": 26, "arabic": "بَيْنَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَnْyَb", "root": "بين"}, {"id": 27, "arabic": "فِيمَا", "translit": "āَmyِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 28, "arabic": "كُنتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtnُk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 29, "arabic": "فِيهِ", "translit": "ِhyِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 30, "arabic": "تَخْتَلِفُونَ", "translit": "َnwُfِlَtْhkَt", "root": "خلف"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 56, "text": "فَأَمَّا ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ فَأُعَذِّبُهُمْ عَذَابًا شَدِيدًا فِى ٱلدُّنْيَا وَٱلْءَاخِرَةِ وَمَا لَهُم مِّن نَّٰصِرِينَ ", "translation": "And as for those who disbelieved, I will punish them with a severe punishment in this world and the Hereafter, and they will have no helpers.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَأَمَّا", "translit": "āَّmَaʾَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translit": "َnyِhdَّlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "كَفَرُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُrَfَk", "root": "كفر"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "فَأُعَذِّبُهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhُbِّhdَʿعُaʾَf", "root": "عذب"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "عَذَابًا", "translit": "āًbāَhdَʿع", "root": "عذب"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "شَدِيدًا", "translit": "āًdyِdَhs", "root": "شدد"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "ٱلدُّنْيَا", "translit": "āَyْnُّdlٱ", "root": "دنو"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "وَٱلْءَاخِرَةِ", "translit": "ِẗَrِhkāَءْlٱَw", "root": "اخر"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "لَهُم", "translit": "mُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "مِّن", "translit": "nِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "نَّٰصِرِينَ", "translit": "َnyِrِṣَّٰn", "root": "نصر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 57, "text": "وَأَمَّا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّٰلِحَٰتِ فَيُوَفِّيهِمْ أُجُورَهُمْۗ وَٱللَّهُ لَا يُحِبُّ ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ ", "translation": "But as for those who believed and did righteous deeds, He will give them in full their rewards, and Allāh does not like the wrongdoers.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَأَمَّا", "translit": "āَّmَaʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translit": "َnyِhdَّlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ءَامَنُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُnَmāَء", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "وَعَمِلُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُlِmَʿعَw", "root": "عمل"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلصَّٰلِحَٰتِ", "translit": "ِtَٰḥِlَّٰṣlٱ", "root": "صلح"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "فَيُوَفِّيهِمْ", "translit": "ْmِhyِّfَwُyَf", "root": "وفي"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "أُجُورَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَrwُjgُaʾ", "root": "اجر"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱَw", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "لَا", "translit": "āَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "يُحِبُّ", "translit": "ُّbِḥُy", "root": "حبب"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmِlَّٰẓlٱ", "root": "ظلم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 58, "text": "ذَٰلِكَ نَتْلُوهُ عَلَيْكَ مِنَ ٱلْءَايَٰتِ وَٱلذِّكْرِ ٱلْحَكِيمِ ", "translation": "This is what We recite to you, [O Muḥammad], of [Our] verses and the precise [and wise] message [i.e., the Qur’ān].", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translit": "َkِlَٰhd", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "نَتْلُوهُ", "translit": "ُhwُlْtَn", "root": "تلو"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "عَلَيْكَ", "translit": "َkْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلْءَايَٰتِ", "translit": "ِtَٰyāَءْlٱ", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "وَٱلذِّكْرِ", "translit": "ِrْkِّhdlٱَw", "root": "ذكر"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱلْحَكِيمِ", "translit": "ِmyِkَḥْlٱ", "root": "حكم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 59, "text": "إِنَّ مَثَلَ عِيسَىٰ عِندَ ٱللَّهِ كَمَثَلِ ءَادَمَۖ خَلَقَهُۥ مِن تُرَابٍ ثُمَّ قَالَ لَهُۥ كُن فَيَكُونُ ", "translation": "Indeed, the example of Jesus to Allāh[1] is like that of Adam. He created him from dust; then He said to him, \"Be,\" and he was.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مَثَلَ", "translit": "َlَhtَm", "root": "مثل"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "عِيسَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَsyِʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "عِندَ", "translit": "َdnِʿع", "root": "عند"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "كَمَثَلِ", "translit": "ِlَhtَmَk", "root": "مثل"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ءَادَمَ", "translit": "َmَdāَء", "root": "ادم"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "خَلَقَهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَqَlَhk", "root": "خلق"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "مِن", "translit": "nِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "تُرَابٍ", "translit": "ٍbāَrُt", "root": "ترب"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ثُمَّ", "translit": "َّmُht", "root": ""}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "لَهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "كُن", "translit": "nُk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "فَيَكُونُ", "translit": "ُnwُkَyَf", "root": "كون"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 60, "text": "ٱلْحَقُّ مِن رَّبِّكَ فَلَا تَكُن مِّنَ ٱلْمُمْتَرِينَ ", "translation": "The truth is from your Lord, so do not be among the doubters.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "ٱلْحَقُّ", "translit": "ُّqَḥْlٱ", "root": "حقق"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مِن", "translit": "nِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "رَّبِّكَ", "translit": "َkِّbَّr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "فَلَا", "translit": "āَlَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "تَكُن", "translit": "nُkَt", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "مِّنَ", "translit": "َnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱلْمُمْتَرِينَ", "translit": "َnyِrَtْmُmْlٱ", "root": "مري"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 61, "text": "فَمَنْ حَآجَّكَ فِيهِ مِنۢ بَعْدِ مَا جَآءَكَ مِنَ ٱلْعِلْمِ فَقُلْ تَعَالَوْا۟ نَدْعُ أَبْنَآءَنَا وَأَبْنَآءَكُمْ وَنِسَآءَنَا وَنِسَآءَكُمْ وَأَنفُسَنَا وَأَنفُسَكُمْ ثُمَّ نَبْتَهِلْ فَنَجْعَل لَّعْنَتَ ٱللَّهِ عَلَى ٱلْكَٰذِبِينَ ", "translation": "Then whoever argues with you about it after [this] knowledge has come to you - say, \"Come, let us call our sons and your sons, our women and your women, ourselves and yourselves, then supplicate earnestly [together] and invoke the curse of Allāh upon the liars [among us].\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَمَنْ", "translit": "ْnَmَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "حَآجَّكَ", "translit": "َkَّjgٓāَḥ", "root": "حجج"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "فِيهِ", "translit": "ِhyِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مِنۢ", "translit": "ۢnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "بَعْدِ", "translit": "ِdْʿعَb", "root": "بعد"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "جَآءَكَ", "translit": "َkَءٓāَjg", "root": "جيا"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "ٱلْعِلْمِ", "translit": "ِmْlِʿعْlٱ", "root": "علم"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "فَقُلْ", "translit": "ْlُqَf", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "تَعَالَوْا۟", "translit": "۟āْwَlāَʿعَt", "root": "علو"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "نَدْعُ", "translit": "ُʿعْdَn", "root": "دعو"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "أَبْنَآءَنَا", "translit": "āَnَءٓāَnْbَaʾ", "root": "بني"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "وَأَبْنَآءَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَءٓāَnْbَaʾَw", "root": "بني"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "وَنِسَآءَنَا", "translit": "āَnَءٓāَsِnَw", "root": "نسو"}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "وَنِسَآءَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَءٓāَsِnَw", "root": "نسو"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "وَأَنفُسَنَا", "translit": "āَnَsُfnَaʾَw", "root": "نفس"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "وَأَنفُسَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَsُfnَaʾَw", "root": "نفس"}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "ثُمَّ", "translit": "َّmُht", "root": ""}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "نَبْتَهِلْ", "translit": "ْlِhَtْbَn", "root": "بهل"}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "فَنَجْعَل", "translit": "lَʿعْjgَnَf", "root": "جعل"}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "لَّعْنَتَ", "translit": "َtَnْʿعَّl", "root": "لعن"}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 24, "arabic": "عَلَى", "translit": "àَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 25, "arabic": "ٱلْكَٰذِبِينَ", "translit": "َnyِbِhdَٰkْlٱ", "root": "كذب"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 62, "text": "إِنَّ هَٰذَا لَهُوَ ٱلْقَصَصُ ٱلْحَقُّۚ وَمَا مِنْ إِلَٰهٍ إِلَّا ٱللَّهُۚ وَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَهُوَ ٱلْعَزِيزُ ٱلْحَكِيمُ ", "translation": "Indeed, this is the true narration. And there is no deity except Allāh. And indeed, Allāh is the Exalted in Might, the Wise.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "هَٰذَا", "translit": "āَhdَٰh", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَهُوَ", "translit": "َwُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْقَصَصُ", "translit": "ُṣَṣَqْlٱ", "root": "قصص"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلْحَقُّ", "translit": "ُّqَḥْlٱ", "root": "حقق"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "مِنْ", "translit": "ْnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "إِلَٰهٍ", "translit": "ٍhَٰlِiʾ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "ٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "وَإِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "لَهُوَ", "translit": "َwُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "ٱلْعَزِيزُ", "translit": "ُzyِzَʿعْlٱ", "root": "عزز"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "ٱلْحَكِيمُ", "translit": "ُmyِkَḥْlٱ", "root": "حكم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 63, "text": "فَإِن تَوَلَّوْا۟ فَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ عَلِيمٌۢ بِٱلْمُفْسِدِينَ ", "translation": "But if they turn away, then indeed - Allāh is Knowing of the corrupters.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَإِن", "translit": "nِiʾَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "تَوَلَّوْا۟", "translit": "۟āْwَّlَwَt", "root": "ولي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "فَإِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "عَلِيمٌۢ", "translit": "ٌۢmyِlَʿع", "root": "علم"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "بِٱلْمُفْسِدِينَ", "translit": "َnyِdِsْfُmْlٱِb", "root": "فسد"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 64, "text": "قُلْ يَٰٓأَهْلَ ٱلْكِتَٰبِ تَعَالَوْا۟ إِلَىٰ كَلِمَةٍ سَوَآءٍۭ بَيْنَنَا وَبَيْنَكُمْ أَلَّا نَعْبُدَ إِلَّا ٱللَّهَ وَلَا نُشْرِكَ بِهِۦ شَيْـًٔا وَلَا يَتَّخِذَ بَعْضُنَا بَعْضًا أَرْبَابًا مِّن دُونِ ٱللَّهِۚ فَإِن تَوَلَّوْا۟ فَقُولُوا۟ ٱشْهَدُوا۟ بِأَنَّا مُسْلِمُونَ ", "translation": "Say, \"O People of the Scripture, come to a word that is equitable between us and you - that we will not worship except Allāh and not associate anything with Him and not take one another as lords instead of Allāh.\"[1] But if they turn away, then say, \"Bear witness that we are Muslims [submitting to Him].\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قُلْ", "translit": "ْlُq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "يَٰٓأَهْلَ", "translit": "َlْhَaʾَٰٓy", "root": "اهل"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلْكِتَٰبِ", "translit": "ِbَٰtِkْlٱ", "root": "كتب"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "تَعَالَوْا۟", "translit": "۟āْwَlāَʿعَt", "root": "علو"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "إِلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "كَلِمَةٍ", "translit": "ٍẗَmِlَk", "root": "كلم"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "سَوَآءٍۭ", "translit": "ٍۭءٓāَwَs", "root": "سوي"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "بَيْنَنَا", "translit": "āَnَnْyَb", "root": "بين"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "وَبَيْنَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَnْyَbَw", "root": "بين"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "أَلَّا", "translit": "āَّlَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "نَعْبُدَ", "translit": "َdُbْʿعَn", "root": "عبد"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "وَلَا", "translit": "āَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "نُشْرِكَ", "translit": "َkِrْhsُn", "root": "شرك"}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "بِهِۦ", "translit": "ۦِhِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "شَيْـًٔا", "translit": "āًٔـْyَhs", "root": "شيا"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "وَلَا", "translit": "āَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "يَتَّخِذَ", "translit": "َhdِhkَّtَy", "root": "اخذ"}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "بَعْضُنَا", "translit": "āَnُḍْʿعَb", "root": "بعض"}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "بَعْضًا", "translit": "āًḍْʿعَb", "root": "بعض"}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "أَرْبَابًا", "translit": "āًbāَbْrَaʾ", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "مِّن", "translit": "nِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 24, "arabic": "دُونِ", "translit": "ِnwُd", "root": "دون"}, {"id": 25, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 26, "arabic": "فَإِن", "translit": "nِiʾَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 27, "arabic": "تَوَلَّوْا۟", "translit": "۟āْwَّlَwَt", "root": "ولي"}, {"id": 28, "arabic": "فَقُولُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُlwُqَf", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 29, "arabic": "ٱشْهَدُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُdَhْhsٱ", "root": "شهد"}, {"id": 30, "arabic": "بِأَنَّا", "translit": "āَّnَaʾِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 31, "arabic": "مُسْلِمُونَ", "translit": "َnwُmِlْsُm", "root": "سلم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 65, "text": "يَٰٓأَهْلَ ٱلْكِتَٰبِ لِمَ تُحَآجُّونَ فِىٓ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ وَمَآ أُنزِلَتِ ٱلتَّوْرَىٰةُ وَٱلْإِنجِيلُ إِلَّا مِنۢ بَعْدِهِۦٓۚ أَفَلَا تَعْقِلُونَ ", "translation": "O People of the Scripture, why do you argue about Abraham while the Torah and the Gospel were not revealed until after him? Then will you not reason?", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "يَٰٓأَهْلَ", "translit": "َlْhَaʾَٰٓy", "root": "اهل"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلْكِتَٰبِ", "translit": "ِbَٰtِkْlٱ", "root": "كتب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لِمَ", "translit": "َmِl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "تُحَآجُّونَ", "translit": "َnwُّjgٓāَḥُt", "root": "حجج"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "فِىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "إِبْرَٰهِيمَ", "translit": "َmyِhَٰrْbِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "وَمَآ", "translit": "ٓāَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "أُنزِلَتِ", "translit": "ِtَlِznُaʾ", "root": "نزل"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "ٱلتَّوْرَىٰةُ", "translit": "ُẗٰàَrْwَّtlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "وَٱلْإِنجِيلُ", "translit": "ُlyِjgnِiʾْlٱَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "مِنۢ", "translit": "ۢnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "بَعْدِهِۦٓ", "translit": "ٓۦِhِdْʿعَb", "root": "بعد"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "أَفَلَا", "translit": "āَlَfَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "تَعْقِلُونَ", "translit": "َnwُlِqْʿعَt", "root": "عقل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 66, "text": "هَٰٓأَنتُمْ هَٰٓؤُلَآءِ حَٰجَجْتُمْ فِيمَا لَكُم بِهِۦ عِلْمٌ فَلِمَ تُحَآجُّونَ فِيمَا لَيْسَ لَكُم بِهِۦ عِلْمٌۚ وَٱللَّهُ يَعْلَمُ وَأَنتُمْ لَا تَعْلَمُونَ ", "translation": "Here you are - those who have argued about that of which you have [some] knowledge, but why do you argue about that of which you have no knowledge? And Allāh knows, while you know not.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "هَٰٓأَنتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtnَaʾَٰٓh", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "هَٰٓؤُلَآءِ", "translit": "ِءٓāَlُwʾَٰٓh", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "حَٰجَجْتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtْjgَjgَٰḥ", "root": "حجج"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "فِيمَا", "translit": "āَmyِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "لَكُم", "translit": "mُkَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "بِهِۦ", "translit": "ۦِhِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "عِلْمٌ", "translit": "ٌmْlِʿع", "root": "علم"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "فَلِمَ", "translit": "َmِlَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "تُحَآجُّونَ", "translit": "َnwُّjgٓāَḥُt", "root": "حجج"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "فِيمَا", "translit": "āَmyِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "لَيْسَ", "translit": "َsْyَl", "root": "ليس"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "لَكُم", "translit": "mُkَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "بِهِۦ", "translit": "ۦِhِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "عِلْمٌ", "translit": "ٌmْlِʿع", "root": "علم"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱَw", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "يَعْلَمُ", "translit": "ُmَlْʿعَy", "root": "علم"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "وَأَنتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtnَaʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "لَا", "translit": "āَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "تَعْلَمُونَ", "translit": "َnwُmَlْʿعَt", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 67, "text": "مَا كَانَ إِبْرَٰهِيمُ يَهُودِيًّا وَلَا نَصْرَانِيًّا وَلَٰكِن كَانَ حَنِيفًا مُّسْلِمًا وَمَا كَانَ مِنَ ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ ", "translation": "Abraham was neither a Jew nor a Christian, but he was one inclining toward truth, a Muslim [submitting to Allāh]. And he was not of the polytheists.[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "كَانَ", "translit": "َnāَk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "إِبْرَٰهِيمُ", "translit": "ُmyِhَٰrْbِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "يَهُودِيًّا", "translit": "āًّyِdwُhَy", "root": "هود"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَلَا", "translit": "āَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "نَصْرَانِيًّا", "translit": "āًّyِnāَrْṣَn", "root": "نصر"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "وَلَٰكِن", "translit": "nِkَٰlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "كَانَ", "translit": "َnāَk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "حَنِيفًا", "translit": "āًfyِnَḥ", "root": "حنف"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "مُّسْلِمًا", "translit": "āًmِlْsُّm", "root": "سلم"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "كَانَ", "translit": "َnāَk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ", "translit": "َnyِkِrْhsُmْlٱ", "root": "شرك"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 68, "text": "إِنَّ أَوْلَى ٱلنَّاسِ بِإِبْرَٰهِيمَ لَلَّذِينَ ٱتَّبَعُوهُ وَهَٰذَا ٱلنَّبِىُّ وَٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ۗ وَٱللَّهُ وَلِىُّ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ ", "translation": "Indeed, the most worthy of Abraham among the people are those who followed him [in submission to Allāh] and this prophet [i.e., Muḥammad (ﷺ)] and those who believe [in his message]. And Allāh is the Ally[1] of the believers.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَوْلَى", "translit": "àَlْwَaʾ", "root": "ولي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلنَّاسِ", "translit": "ِsāَّnlٱ", "root": "انس"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "بِإِبْرَٰهِيمَ", "translit": "َmyِhَٰrْbِiʾِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "لَلَّذِينَ", "translit": "َnyِhdَّlَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱتَّبَعُوهُ", "translit": "ُhwُʿعَbَّtٱ", "root": "تبع"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "وَهَٰذَا", "translit": "āَhdَٰhَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "ٱلنَّبِىُّ", "translit": "ُّàِbَّnlٱ", "root": "نبا"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "وَٱلَّذِينَ", "translit": "َnyِhdَّlٱَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "ءَامَنُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُnَmāَء", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱَw", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "وَلِىُّ", "translit": "ُّàِlَw", "root": "ولي"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ", "translit": "َnyِnِmْwʾُmْlٱ", "root": "امن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 69, "text": "وَدَّت طَّآئِفَةٌ مِّنْ أَهْلِ ٱلْكِتَٰبِ لَوْ يُضِلُّونَكُمْ وَمَا يُضِلُّونَ إِلَّآ أَنفُسَهُمْ وَمَا يَشْعُرُونَ ", "translation": "A faction of the People of the Scripture wish they could mislead you. But they do not mislead except themselves, and they perceive [it] not.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَدَّت", "translit": "tَّdَw", "root": "ودد"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "طَّآئِفَةٌ", "translit": "ٌẗَfِyʾٓāَّṭ", "root": "طوف"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مِّنْ", "translit": "ْnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَهْلِ", "translit": "ِlْhَaʾ", "root": "اهل"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلْكِتَٰبِ", "translit": "ِbَٰtِkْlٱ", "root": "كتب"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "لَوْ", "translit": "ْwَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "يُضِلُّونَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَnwُّlِḍُy", "root": "ضلل"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "يُضِلُّونَ", "translit": "َnwُّlِḍُy", "root": "ضلل"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "إِلَّآ", "translit": "ٓāَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "أَنفُسَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَsُfnَaʾ", "root": "نفس"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "يَشْعُرُونَ", "translit": "َnwُrُʿعْhsَy", "root": "شعر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 70, "text": "يَٰٓأَهْلَ ٱلْكِتَٰبِ لِمَ تَكْفُرُونَ بِـَٔايَٰتِ ٱللَّهِ وَأَنتُمْ تَشْهَدُونَ ", "translation": "O People of the Scripture, why do you disbelieve in the verses of Allāh[1] while you witness [to their truth]?", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "يَٰٓأَهْلَ", "translit": "َlْhَaʾَٰٓy", "root": "اهل"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلْكِتَٰبِ", "translit": "ِbَٰtِkْlٱ", "root": "كتب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لِمَ", "translit": "َmِl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "تَكْفُرُونَ", "translit": "َnwُrُfْkَt", "root": "كفر"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "بِـَٔايَٰتِ", "translit": "ِtَٰyāَٔـِb", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "وَأَنتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtnَaʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "تَشْهَدُونَ", "translit": "َnwُdَhْhsَt", "root": "شهد"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 71, "text": "يَٰٓأَهْلَ ٱلْكِتَٰبِ لِمَ تَلْبِسُونَ ٱلْحَقَّ بِٱلْبَٰطِلِ وَتَكْتُمُونَ ٱلْحَقَّ وَأَنتُمْ تَعْلَمُونَ ", "translation": "O People of the Scripture, why do you mix [i.e., confuse] the truth with falsehood and conceal the truth while you know [it]?", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "يَٰٓأَهْلَ", "translit": "َlْhَaʾَٰٓy", "root": "اهل"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلْكِتَٰبِ", "translit": "ِbَٰtِkْlٱ", "root": "كتب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لِمَ", "translit": "َmِl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "تَلْبِسُونَ", "translit": "َnwُsِbْlَt", "root": "لبس"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلْحَقَّ", "translit": "َّqَḥْlٱ", "root": "حقق"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "بِٱلْبَٰطِلِ", "translit": "ِlِṭَٰbْlٱِb", "root": "بطل"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "وَتَكْتُمُونَ", "translit": "َnwُmُtْkَtَw", "root": "كتم"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "ٱلْحَقَّ", "translit": "َّqَḥْlٱ", "root": "حقق"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "وَأَنتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtnَaʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "تَعْلَمُونَ", "translit": "َnwُmَlْʿعَt", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 72, "text": "وَقَالَت طَّآئِفَةٌ مِّنْ أَهْلِ ٱلْكِتَٰبِ ءَامِنُوا۟ بِٱلَّذِىٓ أُنزِلَ عَلَى ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَجْهَ ٱلنَّهَارِ وَٱكْفُرُوٓا۟ ءَاخِرَهُۥ لَعَلَّهُمْ يَرْجِعُونَ ", "translation": "And a faction of the People of the Scripture say [to each other], \"Believe in that which was revealed to the believers at the beginning of the day and reject it at its end that perhaps they will return [i.e., abandon their religion],", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَقَالَت", "translit": "tَlāَqَw", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "طَّآئِفَةٌ", "translit": "ٌẗَfِyʾٓāَّṭ", "root": "طوف"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مِّنْ", "translit": "ْnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَهْلِ", "translit": "ِlْhَaʾ", "root": "اهل"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلْكِتَٰبِ", "translit": "ِbَٰtِkْlٱ", "root": "كتب"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ءَامِنُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُnِmāَء", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "بِٱلَّذِىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِhdَّlٱِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "أُنزِلَ", "translit": "َlِznُaʾ", "root": "نزل"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "عَلَى", "translit": "àَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translit": "َnyِhdَّlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ءَامَنُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُnَmāَء", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "وَجْهَ", "translit": "َhْjgَw", "root": "وجه"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "ٱلنَّهَارِ", "translit": "ِrāَhَّnlٱ", "root": "نهر"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "وَٱكْفُرُوٓا۟", "translit": "۟āٓwُrُfْkٱَw", "root": "كفر"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "ءَاخِرَهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَrِhkāَء", "root": "اخر"}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "لَعَلَّهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَّlَʿعَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "يَرْجِعُونَ", "translit": "َnwُʿعِjgْrَy", "root": "رجع"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 73, "text": "وَلَا تُؤْمِنُوٓا۟ إِلَّا لِمَن تَبِعَ دِينَكُمْ قُلْ إِنَّ ٱلْهُدَىٰ هُدَى ٱللَّهِ أَن يُؤْتَىٰٓ أَحَدٌ مِّثْلَ مَآ أُوتِيتُمْ أَوْ يُحَآجُّوكُمْ عِندَ رَبِّكُمْۗ قُلْ إِنَّ ٱلْفَضْلَ بِيَدِ ٱللَّهِ يُؤْتِيهِ مَن يَشَآءُۗ وَٱللَّهُ وَٰسِعٌ عَلِيمٌ ", "translation": "And do not trust except those who follow your religion.\" Say, \"Indeed, the [true] guidance is the guidance of Allāh. [Do you fear] lest someone be given [knowledge] like you were given or that they would [thereby] argue with you before your Lord?\" Say, \"Indeed, [all] bounty is in the hand[1] of Allāh - He grants it to whom He wills. And Allāh is all-Encompassing and Wise.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَلَا", "translit": "āَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "تُؤْمِنُوٓا۟", "translit": "۟āٓwُnِmْwʾُt", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "لِمَن", "translit": "nَmِl", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "تَبِعَ", "translit": "َʿعِbَt", "root": "تبع"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "دِينَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَnyِd", "root": "دين"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "قُلْ", "translit": "ْlُq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "ٱلْهُدَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَdُhْlٱ", "root": "هدي"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "هُدَى", "translit": "àَdُh", "root": "هدي"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "أَن", "translit": "nَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "يُؤْتَىٰٓ", "translit": "ٰٓàَtْwʾُy", "root": "اتي"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "أَحَدٌ", "translit": "ٌdَḥَaʾ", "root": "احد"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "مِّثْلَ", "translit": "َlْhtِّm", "root": "مثل"}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "مَآ", "translit": "ٓāَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "أُوتِيتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtyِtwُaʾ", "root": "اتي"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "أَوْ", "translit": "ْwَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "يُحَآجُّوكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkwُّjgٓāَḥُy", "root": "حجج"}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "عِندَ", "translit": "َdnِʿع", "root": "عند"}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "رَبِّكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "قُلْ", "translit": "ْlُq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 24, "arabic": "ٱلْفَضْلَ", "translit": "َlْḍَfْlٱ", "root": "فضل"}, {"id": 25, "arabic": "بِيَدِ", "translit": "ِdَyِb", "root": "يدي"}, {"id": 26, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 27, "arabic": "يُؤْتِيهِ", "translit": "ِhyِtْwʾُy", "root": "اتي"}, {"id": 28, "arabic": "مَن", "translit": "nَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 29, "arabic": "يَشَآءُ", "translit": "ُءٓāَhsَy", "root": "شيا"}, {"id": 30, "arabic": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱَw", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 31, "arabic": "وَٰسِعٌ", "translit": "ٌʿعِsَٰw", "root": "وسع"}, {"id": 32, "arabic": "عَلِيمٌ", "translit": "ٌmyِlَʿع", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 74, "text": "يَخْتَصُّ بِرَحْمَتِهِۦ مَن يَشَآءُۗ وَٱللَّهُ ذُو ٱلْفَضْلِ ٱلْعَظِيمِ ", "translation": "He selects for His mercy whom He wills. And Allāh is the possessor of great bounty.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "يَخْتَصُّ", "translit": "ُّṣَtْhkَy", "root": "خصص"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "بِرَحْمَتِهِۦ", "translit": "ۦِhِtَmْḥَrِb", "root": "رحم"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مَن", "translit": "nَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "يَشَآءُ", "translit": "ُءٓāَhsَy", "root": "شيا"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱَw", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ذُو", "translit": "wُhd", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱلْفَضْلِ", "translit": "ِlْḍَfْlٱ", "root": "فضل"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "ٱلْعَظِيمِ", "translit": "ِmyِẓَʿعْlٱ", "root": "عظم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 75, "text": "وَمِنْ أَهْلِ ٱلْكِتَٰبِ مَنْ إِن تَأْمَنْهُ بِقِنطَارٍ يُؤَدِّهِۦٓ إِلَيْكَ وَمِنْهُم مَّنْ إِن تَأْمَنْهُ بِدِينَارٍ لَّا يُؤَدِّهِۦٓ إِلَيْكَ إِلَّا مَا دُمْتَ عَلَيْهِ قَآئِمًاۗ ذَٰلِكَ بِأَنَّهُمْ قَالُوا۟ لَيْسَ عَلَيْنَا فِى ٱلْأُمِّيِّۦنَ سَبِيلٌ وَيَقُولُونَ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ ٱلْكَذِبَ وَهُمْ يَعْلَمُونَ ", "translation": "And among the People of the Scripture is he who, if you entrust him with a great amount [of wealth], he will return it to you. And among them is he who, if you entrust him with a [single] coin, he will not return it to you unless you are constantly standing over him [demanding it]. That is because they say, \"There is no blame upon us concerning the unlearned.\"[1] And they speak untruth about Allāh while they know [it].", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَمِنْ", "translit": "ْnِmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَهْلِ", "translit": "ِlْhَaʾ", "root": "اهل"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلْكِتَٰبِ", "translit": "ِbَٰtِkْlٱ", "root": "كتب"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مَنْ", "translit": "ْnَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "إِن", "translit": "nِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "تَأْمَنْهُ", "translit": "ُhْnَmْaʾَt", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "بِقِنطَارٍ", "translit": "ٍrāَṭnِqِb", "root": "قنطر"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "يُؤَدِّهِۦٓ", "translit": "ٓۦِhِّdَwʾُy", "root": "ادي"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "إِلَيْكَ", "translit": "َkْyَlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "وَمِنْهُم", "translit": "mُhْnِmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "مَّنْ", "translit": "ْnَّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "إِن", "translit": "nِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "تَأْمَنْهُ", "translit": "ُhْnَmْaʾَt", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "بِدِينَارٍ", "translit": "ٍrāَnyِdِb", "root": "دنر"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "لَّا", "translit": "āَّl", "root": ""}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "يُؤَدِّهِۦٓ", "translit": "ٓۦِhِّdَwʾُy", "root": "ادي"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "إِلَيْكَ", "translit": "َkْyَlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "دُمْتَ", "translit": "َtْmُd", "root": "دوم"}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "عَلَيْهِ", "translit": "ِhْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "قَآئِمًا", "translit": "āًmِyʾٓāَq", "root": "قوم"}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translit": "َkِlَٰhd", "root": ""}, {"id": 24, "arabic": "بِأَنَّهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَّnَaʾِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 25, "arabic": "قَالُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 26, "arabic": "لَيْسَ", "translit": "َsْyَl", "root": "ليس"}, {"id": 27, "arabic": "عَلَيْنَا", "translit": "āَnْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 28, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 29, "arabic": "ٱلْأُمِّيِّۦنَ", "translit": "َnۦِّyِّmُaʾْlٱ", "root": "امم"}, {"id": 30, "arabic": "سَبِيلٌ", "translit": "ٌlyِbَs", "root": "سبل"}, {"id": 31, "arabic": "وَيَقُولُونَ", "translit": "َnwُlwُqَyَw", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 32, "arabic": "عَلَى", "translit": "àَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 33, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 34, "arabic": "ٱلْكَذِبَ", "translit": "َbِhdَkْlٱ", "root": "كذب"}, {"id": 35, "arabic": "وَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 36, "arabic": "يَعْلَمُونَ", "translit": "َnwُmَlْʿعَy", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 76, "text": "بَلَىٰ مَنْ أَوْفَىٰ بِعَهْدِهِۦ وَٱتَّقَىٰ فَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ يُحِبُّ ٱلْمُتَّقِينَ ", "translation": "But yes, whoever fulfills his commitment and fears Allāh - then indeed, Allāh loves those who fear Him.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "بَلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlَb", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مَنْ", "translit": "ْnَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أَوْفَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَfْwَaʾ", "root": "وفي"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "بِعَهْدِهِۦ", "translit": "ۦِhِdْhَʿعِb", "root": "عهد"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَٱتَّقَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَqَّtٱَw", "root": "وقي"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "فَإِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "يُحِبُّ", "translit": "ُّbِḥُy", "root": "حبب"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "ٱلْمُتَّقِينَ", "translit": "َnyِqَّtُmْlٱ", "root": "وقي"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 77, "text": "إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ يَشْتَرُونَ بِعَهْدِ ٱللَّهِ وَأَيْمَٰنِهِمْ ثَمَنًا قَلِيلًا أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ لَا خَلَٰقَ لَهُمْ فِى ٱلْءَاخِرَةِ وَلَا يُكَلِّمُهُمُ ٱللَّهُ وَلَا يَنظُرُ إِلَيْهِمْ يَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَٰمَةِ وَلَا يُزَكِّيهِمْ وَلَهُمْ عَذَابٌ أَلِيمٌ ", "translation": "Indeed, those who exchange the covenant of Allāh and their [own] oaths for a small price will have no share in the Hereafter, and Allāh will not speak to them or look at them on the Day of Resurrection, nor will He purify them; and they will have a painful punishment.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translit": "َnyِhdَّlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "يَشْتَرُونَ", "translit": "َnwُrَtْhsَy", "root": "شري"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "بِعَهْدِ", "translit": "ِdْhَʿعِb", "root": "عهد"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "وَأَيْمَٰنِهِمْ", "translit": "ْmِhِnَٰmْyَaʾَw", "root": "يمن"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ثَمَنًا", "translit": "āًnَmَht", "root": "ثمن"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "قَلِيلًا", "translit": "āًlyِlَq", "root": "قلل"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ", "translit": "َkِyʾَٰٓl۟wُaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "لَا", "translit": "āَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "خَلَٰقَ", "translit": "َqَٰlَhk", "root": "خلق"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "لَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "ٱلْءَاخِرَةِ", "translit": "ِẗَrِhkāَءْlٱ", "root": "اخر"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "وَلَا", "translit": "āَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "يُكَلِّمُهُمُ", "translit": "ُmُhُmِّlَkُy", "root": "كلم"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "ٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "وَلَا", "translit": "āَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "يَنظُرُ", "translit": "ُrُẓnَy", "root": "نظر"}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "إِلَيْهِمْ", "translit": "ْmِhْyَlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "يَوْمَ", "translit": "َmْwَy", "root": "يوم"}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "ٱلْقِيَٰمَةِ", "translit": "ِẗَmَٰyِqْlٱ", "root": "قوم"}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "وَلَا", "translit": "āَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 24, "arabic": "يُزَكِّيهِمْ", "translit": "ْmِhyِّkَzُy", "root": "زكو"}, {"id": 25, "arabic": "وَلَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 26, "arabic": "عَذَابٌ", "translit": "ٌbāَhdَʿع", "root": "عذب"}, {"id": 27, "arabic": "أَلِيمٌ", "translit": "ٌmyِlَaʾ", "root": "الم"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 78, "text": "وَإِنَّ مِنْهُمْ لَفَرِيقًا يَلْوُۥنَ أَلْسِنَتَهُم بِٱلْكِتَٰبِ لِتَحْسَبُوهُ مِنَ ٱلْكِتَٰبِ وَمَا هُوَ مِنَ ٱلْكِتَٰبِ وَيَقُولُونَ هُوَ مِنْ عِندِ ٱللَّهِ وَمَا هُوَ مِنْ عِندِ ٱللَّهِ وَيَقُولُونَ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ ٱلْكَذِبَ وَهُمْ يَعْلَمُونَ ", "translation": "And indeed, there is among them a party who alter the Scripture with their tongues so you may think it is from the Scripture, but it is not from the Scripture. And they say, \"This is from Allāh,\" but it is not from Allāh. And they speak untruth about Allāh while they know.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مِنْهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhْnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَفَرِيقًا", "translit": "āًqyِrَfَl", "root": "فرق"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "يَلْوُۥنَ", "translit": "َnۥُwْlَy", "root": "لوي"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "أَلْسِنَتَهُم", "translit": "mُhَtَnِsْlَaʾ", "root": "لسن"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "بِٱلْكِتَٰبِ", "translit": "ِbَٰtِkْlٱِb", "root": "كتب"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "لِتَحْسَبُوهُ", "translit": "ُhwُbَsْḥَtِl", "root": "حسب"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "ٱلْكِتَٰبِ", "translit": "ِbَٰtِkْlٱ", "root": "كتب"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "هُوَ", "translit": "َwُh", "root": ""}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "ٱلْكِتَٰبِ", "translit": "ِbَٰtِkْlٱ", "root": "كتب"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "وَيَقُولُونَ", "translit": "َnwُlwُqَyَw", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "هُوَ", "translit": "َwُh", "root": ""}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "مِنْ", "translit": "ْnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "عِندِ", "translit": "ِdnِʿع", "root": "عند"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "هُوَ", "translit": "َwُh", "root": ""}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "مِنْ", "translit": "ْnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "عِندِ", "translit": "ِdnِʿع", "root": "عند"}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 24, "arabic": "وَيَقُولُونَ", "translit": "َnwُlwُqَyَw", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 25, "arabic": "عَلَى", "translit": "àَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 26, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 27, "arabic": "ٱلْكَذِبَ", "translit": "َbِhdَkْlٱ", "root": "كذب"}, {"id": 28, "arabic": "وَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 29, "arabic": "يَعْلَمُونَ", "translit": "َnwُmَlْʿعَy", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 79, "text": "مَا كَانَ لِبَشَرٍ أَن يُؤْتِيَهُ ٱللَّهُ ٱلْكِتَٰبَ وَٱلْحُكْمَ وَٱلنُّبُوَّةَ ثُمَّ يَقُولَ لِلنَّاسِ كُونُوا۟ عِبَادًا لِّى مِن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ وَلَٰكِن كُونُوا۟ رَبَّٰنِيِّۦنَ بِمَا كُنتُمْ تُعَلِّمُونَ ٱلْكِتَٰبَ وَبِمَا كُنتُمْ تَدْرُسُونَ ", "translation": "It is not for a human [prophet][1] that Allāh should give him the Scripture[2] and authority and prophethood and then he would say to the people, \"Be servants to me rather than Allāh,\" but [instead, he would say], \"Be pious scholars of the Lord because of what you have taught of the Scripture and because of what you have studied.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "كَانَ", "translit": "َnāَk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لِبَشَرٍ", "translit": "ٍrَhsَbِl", "root": "بشر"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَن", "translit": "nَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "يُؤْتِيَهُ", "translit": "ُhَyِtْwʾُy", "root": "اتي"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱلْكِتَٰبَ", "translit": "َbَٰtِkْlٱ", "root": "كتب"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "وَٱلْحُكْمَ", "translit": "َmْkُḥْlٱَw", "root": "حكم"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "وَٱلنُّبُوَّةَ", "translit": "َẗَّwُbُّnlٱَw", "root": "نبا"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "ثُمَّ", "translit": "َّmُht", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "يَقُولَ", "translit": "َlwُqَy", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "لِلنَّاسِ", "translit": "ِsāَّnlِl", "root": "انس"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "كُونُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُnwُk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "عِبَادًا", "translit": "āًdāَbِʿع", "root": "عبد"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "لِّى", "translit": "àِّl", "root": ""}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "مِن", "translit": "nِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "دُونِ", "translit": "ِnwُd", "root": "دون"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "وَلَٰكِن", "translit": "nِkَٰlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "كُونُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُnwُk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "رَبَّٰنِيِّۦنَ", "translit": "َnۦِّyِnَّٰbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "بِمَا", "translit": "āَmِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "كُنتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtnُk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 24, "arabic": "تُعَلِّمُونَ", "translit": "َnwُmِّlَʿعُt", "root": "علم"}, {"id": 25, "arabic": "ٱلْكِتَٰبَ", "translit": "َbَٰtِkْlٱ", "root": "كتب"}, {"id": 26, "arabic": "وَبِمَا", "translit": "āَmِbَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 27, "arabic": "كُنتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtnُk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 28, "arabic": "تَدْرُسُونَ", "translit": "َnwُsُrْdَt", "root": "درس"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 80, "text": "وَلَا يَأْمُرَكُمْ أَن تَتَّخِذُوا۟ ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةَ وَٱلنَّبِيِّۦنَ أَرْبَابًاۗ أَيَأْمُرُكُم بِٱلْكُفْرِ بَعْدَ إِذْ أَنتُم مُّسْلِمُونَ ", "translation": "Nor could he order you to take the angels and prophets as lords. Would he order you to disbelief after you had been Muslims?", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَلَا", "translit": "āَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "يَأْمُرَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَrُmْaʾَy", "root": "امر"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أَن", "translit": "nَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "تَتَّخِذُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُhdِhkَّtَt", "root": "اخذ"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةَ", "translit": "َẗَkِyʾَٰٓlَmْlٱ", "root": "ملك"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "وَٱلنَّبِيِّۦنَ", "translit": "َnۦِّyِbَّnlٱَw", "root": "نبا"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "أَرْبَابًا", "translit": "āًbāَbْrَaʾ", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "أَيَأْمُرُكُم", "translit": "mُkُrُmْaʾَyَaʾ", "root": "امر"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "بِٱلْكُفْرِ", "translit": "ِrْfُkْlٱِb", "root": "كفر"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "بَعْدَ", "translit": "َdْʿعَb", "root": "بعد"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "إِذْ", "translit": "ْhdِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "أَنتُم", "translit": "mُtnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "مُّسْلِمُونَ", "translit": "َnwُmِlْsُّm", "root": "سلم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 81, "text": "وَإِذْ أَخَذَ ٱللَّهُ مِيثَٰقَ ٱلنَّبِيِّۦنَ لَمَآ ءَاتَيْتُكُم مِّن كِتَٰبٍ وَحِكْمَةٍ ثُمَّ جَآءَكُمْ رَسُولٌ مُّصَدِّقٌ لِّمَا مَعَكُمْ لَتُؤْمِنُنَّ بِهِۦ وَلَتَنصُرُنَّهُۥۚ قَالَ ءَأَقْرَرْتُمْ وَأَخَذْتُمْ عَلَىٰ ذَٰلِكُمْ إِصْرِىۖ قَالُوٓا۟ أَقْرَرْنَاۚ قَالَ فَٱشْهَدُوا۟ وَأَنَا۠ مَعَكُم مِّنَ ٱلشَّٰهِدِينَ ", "translation": "And [recall, O People of the Scripture], when Allāh took the covenant of the prophets, [saying], \"Whatever I give you of the Scripture and wisdom and then there comes to you a messenger confirming what is with you, you [must] believe in him and support him.\" [Allāh] said, \"Have you acknowledged and taken upon that My commitment?\"[1] They said, \"We have acknowledged it.\" He said, \"Then bear witness, and I am with you among the witnesses.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِذْ", "translit": "ْhdِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَخَذَ", "translit": "َhdَhkَaʾ", "root": "اخذ"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مِيثَٰقَ", "translit": "َqَٰhtyِm", "root": "وثق"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلنَّبِيِّۦنَ", "translit": "َnۦِّyِbَّnlٱ", "root": "نبا"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "لَمَآ", "translit": "ٓāَmَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ءَاتَيْتُكُم", "translit": "mُkُtْyَtāَء", "root": "اتي"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "مِّن", "translit": "nِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "كِتَٰبٍ", "translit": "ٍbَٰtِk", "root": "كتب"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "وَحِكْمَةٍ", "translit": "ٍẗَmْkِḥَw", "root": "حكم"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ثُمَّ", "translit": "َّmُht", "root": ""}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "جَآءَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَءٓāَjg", "root": "جيا"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "رَسُولٌ", "translit": "ٌlwُsَr", "root": "رسل"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "مُّصَدِّقٌ", "translit": "ٌqِّdَṣُّm", "root": "صدق"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "لِّمَا", "translit": "āَmِّl", "root": ""}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "مَعَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَʿعَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "لَتُؤْمِنُنَّ", "translit": "َّnُnِmْwʾُtَl", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "بِهِۦ", "translit": "ۦِhِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "وَلَتَنصُرُنَّهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَّnُrُṣnَtَlَw", "root": "نصر"}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "ءَأَقْرَرْتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtْrَrْqَaʾَء", "root": "قرر"}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "وَأَخَذْتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtْhdَhkَaʾَw", "root": "اخذ"}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "عَلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 24, "arabic": "ذَٰلِكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkِlَٰhd", "root": ""}, {"id": 25, "arabic": "إِصْرِى", "translit": "àِrْṣِiʾ", "root": "اصر"}, {"id": 26, "arabic": "قَالُوٓا۟", "translit": "۟āٓwُlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 27, "arabic": "أَقْرَرْنَا", "translit": "āَnْrَrْqَaʾ", "root": "قرر"}, {"id": 28, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 29, "arabic": "فَٱشْهَدُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُdَhْhsٱَf", "root": "شهد"}, {"id": 30, "arabic": "وَأَنَا۠", "translit": "۠āَnَaʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 31, "arabic": "مَعَكُم", "translit": "mُkَʿعَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 32, "arabic": "مِّنَ", "translit": "َnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 33, "arabic": "ٱلشَّٰهِدِينَ", "translit": "َnyِdِhَّٰhslٱ", "root": "شهد"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 82, "text": "فَمَن تَوَلَّىٰ بَعْدَ ذَٰلِكَ فَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلْفَٰسِقُونَ ", "translation": "And whoever turned away after that - they were the defiantly disobedient.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَمَن", "translit": "nَmَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "تَوَلَّىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَّlَwَt", "root": "ولي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "بَعْدَ", "translit": "َdْʿعَb", "root": "بعد"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translit": "َkِlَٰhd", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "فَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ", "translit": "َkِyʾَٰٓl۟wُaʾَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "هُمُ", "translit": "ُmُh", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱلْفَٰسِقُونَ", "translit": "َnwُqِsَٰfْlٱ", "root": "فسق"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 83, "text": "أَفَغَيْرَ دِينِ ٱللَّهِ يَبْغُونَ وَلَهُۥٓ أَسْلَمَ مَن فِى ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ طَوْعًا وَكَرْهًا وَإِلَيْهِ يُرْجَعُونَ ", "translation": "So is it other than the religion of Allāh they desire, while to Him have submitted [all] those within the heavens and earth, willingly or by compulsion, and to Him they will be returned?", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "أَفَغَيْرَ", "translit": "َrْyَغَfَaʾ", "root": "غير"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "دِينِ", "translit": "ِnyِd", "root": "دين"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "يَبْغُونَ", "translit": "َnwُغْbَy", "root": "بغي"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَلَهُۥٓ", "translit": "ٓۥُhَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "أَسْلَمَ", "translit": "َmَlْsَaʾ", "root": "سلم"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "مَن", "translit": "nَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ", "translit": "ِtَٰwَٰmَّslٱ", "root": "سمو"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "وَٱلْأَرْضِ", "translit": "ِḍْrَaʾْlٱَw", "root": "ارض"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "طَوْعًا", "translit": "āًʿعْwَṭ", "root": "طوع"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "وَكَرْهًا", "translit": "āًhْrَkَw", "root": "كره"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "وَإِلَيْهِ", "translit": "ِhْyَlِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "يُرْجَعُونَ", "translit": "َnwُʿعَjgْrُy", "root": "رجع"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 84, "text": "قُلْ ءَامَنَّا بِٱللَّهِ وَمَآ أُنزِلَ عَلَيْنَا وَمَآ أُنزِلَ عَلَىٰٓ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ وَإِسْمَٰعِيلَ وَإِسْحَٰقَ وَيَعْقُوبَ وَٱلْأَسْبَاطِ وَمَآ أُوتِىَ مُوسَىٰ وَعِيسَىٰ وَٱلنَّبِيُّونَ مِن رَّبِّهِمْ لَا نُفَرِّقُ بَيْنَ أَحَدٍ مِّنْهُمْ وَنَحْنُ لَهُۥ مُسْلِمُونَ ", "translation": "Say, \"We have believed in Allāh and in what was revealed to us and what was revealed to Abraham, Ishmael, Isaac, Jacob, and the Descendants [al-Asbāṭ], and in what was given to Moses and Jesus and to the prophets from their Lord. We make no distinction between any of them, and we are Muslims [submitting] to Him.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قُلْ", "translit": "ْlُq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ءَامَنَّا", "translit": "āَّnَmāَء", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "بِٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱِb", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "وَمَآ", "translit": "ٓāَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "أُنزِلَ", "translit": "َlِznُaʾ", "root": "نزل"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "عَلَيْنَا", "translit": "āَnْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "وَمَآ", "translit": "ٓāَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "أُنزِلَ", "translit": "َlِznُaʾ", "root": "نزل"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "عَلَىٰٓ", "translit": "ٰٓàَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "إِبْرَٰهِيمَ", "translit": "َmyِhَٰrْbِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "وَإِسْمَٰعِيلَ", "translit": "َlyِʿعَٰmْsِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "وَإِسْحَٰقَ", "translit": "َqَٰḥْsِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "وَيَعْقُوبَ", "translit": "َbwُqْʿعَyَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "وَٱلْأَسْبَاطِ", "translit": "ِṭāَbْsَaʾْlٱَw", "root": "سبط"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "وَمَآ", "translit": "ٓāَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "أُوتِىَ", "translit": "َàِtwُaʾ", "root": "اتي"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "مُوسَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَswُm", "root": ""}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "وَعِيسَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَsyِʿعَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "وَٱلنَّبِيُّونَ", "translit": "َnwُّyِbَّnlٱَw", "root": "نبا"}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "مِن", "translit": "nِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "رَّبِّهِمْ", "translit": "ْmِhِّbَّr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "لَا", "translit": "āَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "نُفَرِّقُ", "translit": "ُqِّrَfُn", "root": "فرق"}, {"id": 24, "arabic": "بَيْنَ", "translit": "َnْyَb", "root": "بين"}, {"id": 25, "arabic": "أَحَدٍ", "translit": "ٍdَḥَaʾ", "root": "احد"}, {"id": 26, "arabic": "مِّنْهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhْnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 27, "arabic": "وَنَحْنُ", "translit": "ُnْḥَnَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 28, "arabic": "لَهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 29, "arabic": "مُسْلِمُونَ", "translit": "َnwُmِlْsُm", "root": "سلم"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 85, "text": "وَمَن يَبْتَغِ غَيْرَ ٱلْإِسْلَٰمِ دِينًا فَلَن يُقْبَلَ مِنْهُ وَهُوَ فِى ٱلْءَاخِرَةِ مِنَ ٱلْخَٰسِرِينَ ", "translation": "And whoever desires other than Islām as religion - never will it be accepted from him, and he, in the Hereafter, will be among the losers.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَمَن", "translit": "nَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "يَبْتَغِ", "translit": "ِغَtْbَy", "root": "بغي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "غَيْرَ", "translit": "َrْyَغ", "root": "غير"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْإِسْلَٰمِ", "translit": "ِmَٰlْsِiʾْlٱ", "root": "سلم"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "دِينًا", "translit": "āًnyِd", "root": "دين"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "فَلَن", "translit": "nَlَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "يُقْبَلَ", "translit": "َlَbْqُy", "root": "قبل"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "مِنْهُ", "translit": "ُhْnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "وَهُوَ", "translit": "َwُhَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ٱلْءَاخِرَةِ", "translit": "ِẗَrِhkāَءْlٱ", "root": "اخر"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "ٱلْخَٰسِرِينَ", "translit": "َnyِrِsَٰhkْlٱ", "root": "خسر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 86, "text": "كَيْفَ يَهْدِى ٱللَّهُ قَوْمًا كَفَرُوا۟ بَعْدَ إِيمَٰنِهِمْ وَشَهِدُوٓا۟ أَنَّ ٱلرَّسُولَ حَقٌّ وَجَآءَهُمُ ٱلْبَيِّنَٰتُۚ وَٱللَّهُ لَا يَهْدِى ٱلْقَوْمَ ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ ", "translation": "How shall Allāh guide a people who disbelieved after their belief and had witnessed that the Messenger is true and clear signs had come to them? And Allāh does not guide the wrongdoing people.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "كَيْفَ", "translit": "َfْyَk", "root": "كيف"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "يَهْدِى", "translit": "àِdْhَy", "root": "هدي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "قَوْمًا", "translit": "āًmْwَq", "root": "قوم"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "كَفَرُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُrَfَk", "root": "كفر"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "بَعْدَ", "translit": "َdْʿعَb", "root": "بعد"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "إِيمَٰنِهِمْ", "translit": "ْmِhِnَٰmyِiʾ", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "وَشَهِدُوٓا۟", "translit": "۟āٓwُdِhَhsَw", "root": "شهد"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "أَنَّ", "translit": "َّnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "ٱلرَّسُولَ", "translit": "َlwُsَّrlٱ", "root": "رسل"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "حَقٌّ", "translit": "ٌّqَḥ", "root": "حقق"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "وَجَآءَهُمُ", "translit": "ُmُhَءٓāَjgَw", "root": "جيا"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "ٱلْبَيِّنَٰتُ", "translit": "ُtَٰnِّyَbْlٱ", "root": "بين"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱَw", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "لَا", "translit": "āَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "يَهْدِى", "translit": "àِdْhَy", "root": "هدي"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "ٱلْقَوْمَ", "translit": "َmْwَqْlٱ", "root": "قوم"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmِlَّٰẓlٱ", "root": "ظلم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 87, "text": "أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ جَزَآؤُهُمْ أَنَّ عَلَيْهِمْ لَعْنَةَ ٱللَّهِ وَٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةِ وَٱلنَّاسِ أَجْمَعِينَ ", "translation": "Those - their recompense will be that upon them is the curse of Allāh and the angels and the people, all together,", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ", "translit": "َkِyʾَٰٓl۟wُaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "جَزَآؤُهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhُwʾٓāَzَjg", "root": "جزي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أَنَّ", "translit": "َّnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "عَلَيْهِمْ", "translit": "ْmِhْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "لَعْنَةَ", "translit": "َẗَnْʿعَl", "root": "لعن"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "وَٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةِ", "translit": "ِẗَkِyʾَٰٓlَmْlٱَw", "root": "ملك"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "وَٱلنَّاسِ", "translit": "ِsāَّnlٱَw", "root": "انس"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "أَجْمَعِينَ", "translit": "َnyِʿعَmْjgَaʾ", "root": "جمع"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 88, "text": "خَٰلِدِينَ فِيهَا لَا يُخَفَّفُ عَنْهُمُ ٱلْعَذَابُ وَلَا هُمْ يُنظَرُونَ ", "translation": "Abiding eternally therein. The punishment will not be lightened for them, nor will they be reprieved,", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "خَٰلِدِينَ", "translit": "َnyِdِlَٰhk", "root": "خلد"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "فِيهَا", "translit": "āَhyِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَا", "translit": "āَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "يُخَفَّفُ", "translit": "ُfَّfَhkُy", "root": "خفف"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "عَنْهُمُ", "translit": "ُmُhْnَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱلْعَذَابُ", "translit": "ُbāَhdَʿعْlٱ", "root": "عذب"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "وَلَا", "translit": "āَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "هُمْ", "translit": "ْmُh", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "يُنظَرُونَ", "translit": "َnwُrَẓnُy", "root": "نظر"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 89, "text": "إِلَّا ٱلَّذِينَ تَابُوا۟ مِنۢ بَعْدِ ذَٰلِكَ وَأَصْلَحُوا۟ فَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ غَفُورٌ رَّحِيمٌ ", "translation": "Except for those who repent after that[1] and correct themselves. For indeed, Allāh is Forgiving and Merciful.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translit": "َnyِhdَّlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "تَابُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُbāَt", "root": "توب"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مِنۢ", "translit": "ۢnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "بَعْدِ", "translit": "ِdْʿعَb", "root": "بعد"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translit": "َkِlَٰhd", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "وَأَصْلَحُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُḥَlْṣَaʾَw", "root": "صلح"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "فَإِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "غَفُورٌ", "translit": "ٌrwُfَغ", "root": "غفر"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "رَّحِيمٌ", "translit": "ٌmyِḥَّr", "root": "رحم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 90, "text": "إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ بَعْدَ إِيمَٰنِهِمْ ثُمَّ ٱزْدَادُوا۟ كُفْرًا لَّن تُقْبَلَ تَوْبَتُهُمْ وَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلضَّآلُّونَ ", "translation": "Indeed, those who disbelieve [i.e., reject the message] after their belief and then increase in disbelief - never will their [claimed] repentance be accepted, and they are the ones astray.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translit": "َnyِhdَّlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "كَفَرُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُrَfَk", "root": "كفر"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "بَعْدَ", "translit": "َdْʿعَb", "root": "بعد"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "إِيمَٰنِهِمْ", "translit": "ْmِhِnَٰmyِiʾ", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ثُمَّ", "translit": "َّmُht", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱزْدَادُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُdāَdْzٱ", "root": "زيد"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "كُفْرًا", "translit": "āًrْfُk", "root": "كفر"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "لَّن", "translit": "nَّl", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "تُقْبَلَ", "translit": "َlَbْqُt", "root": "قبل"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "تَوْبَتُهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhُtَbْwَt", "root": "توب"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "وَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ", "translit": "َkِyʾَٰٓl۟wُaʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "هُمُ", "translit": "ُmُh", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "ٱلضَّآلُّونَ", "translit": "َnwُّlٓāَّḍlٱ", "root": "ضلل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 91, "text": "إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ وَمَاتُوا۟ وَهُمْ كُفَّارٌ فَلَن يُقْبَلَ مِنْ أَحَدِهِم مِّلْءُ ٱلْأَرْضِ ذَهَبًا وَلَوِ ٱفْتَدَىٰ بِهِۦٓۗ أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ لَهُمْ عَذَابٌ أَلِيمٌ وَمَا لَهُم مِّن نَّٰصِرِينَ ", "translation": "Indeed, those who disbelieve and die while they are disbelievers - never would the [whole] capacity of the earth in gold be accepted from one of them if he would [seek to] ransom himself with it. For those there will be a painful punishment, and they will have no helpers.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translit": "َnyِhdَّlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "كَفَرُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُrَfَk", "root": "كفر"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "وَمَاتُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُtāَmَw", "root": "موت"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "كُفَّارٌ", "translit": "ٌrāَّfُk", "root": "كفر"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "فَلَن", "translit": "nَlَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "يُقْبَلَ", "translit": "َlَbْqُy", "root": "قبل"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "مِنْ", "translit": "ْnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "أَحَدِهِم", "translit": "mِhِdَḥَaʾ", "root": "احد"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "مِّلْءُ", "translit": "ُءْlِّm", "root": "ملا"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "ٱلْأَرْضِ", "translit": "ِḍْrَaʾْlٱ", "root": "ارض"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "ذَهَبًا", "translit": "āًbَhَhd", "root": "ذهب"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "وَلَوِ", "translit": "ِwَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "ٱفْتَدَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَdَtْfٱ", "root": "فدي"}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "بِهِۦٓ", "translit": "ٓۦِhِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ", "translit": "َkِyʾَٰٓl۟wُaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "لَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "عَذَابٌ", "translit": "ٌbāَhdَʿع", "root": "عذب"}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "أَلِيمٌ", "translit": "ٌmyِlَaʾ", "root": "الم"}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "لَهُم", "translit": "mُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "مِّن", "translit": "nِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 24, "arabic": "نَّٰصِرِينَ", "translit": "َnyِrِṣَّٰn", "root": "نصر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 92, "text": "لَن تَنَالُوا۟ ٱلْبِرَّ حَتَّىٰ تُنفِقُوا۟ مِمَّا تُحِبُّونَۚ وَمَا تُنفِقُوا۟ مِن شَىْءٍ فَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ بِهِۦ عَلِيمٌ ", "translation": "Never will you attain the good [reward][1] until you spend [in the way of Allāh] from that which you love. And whatever you spend - indeed, Allāh is Knowing of it.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "لَن", "translit": "nَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "تَنَالُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُlāَnَt", "root": "نيل"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلْبِرَّ", "translit": "َّrِbْlٱ", "root": "برر"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "حَتَّىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَّtَḥ", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "تُنفِقُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُqِfnُt", "root": "نفق"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "مِمَّا", "translit": "āَّmِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "تُحِبُّونَ", "translit": "َnwُّbِḥُt", "root": "حبب"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "تُنفِقُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُqِfnُt", "root": "نفق"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "مِن", "translit": "nِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "شَىْءٍ", "translit": "ٍءْàَhs", "root": "شيا"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "فَإِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "بِهِۦ", "translit": "ۦِhِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "عَلِيمٌ", "translit": "ٌmyِlَʿع", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 93, "text": "كُلُّ ٱلطَّعَامِ كَانَ حِلًّا لِّبَنِىٓ إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ إِلَّا مَا حَرَّمَ إِسْرَٰٓءِيلُ عَلَىٰ نَفْسِهِۦ مِن قَبْلِ أَن تُنَزَّلَ ٱلتَّوْرَىٰةُۗ قُلْ فَأْتُوا۟ بِٱلتَّوْرَىٰةِ فَٱتْلُوهَآ إِن كُنتُمْ صَٰدِقِينَ ", "translation": "All food was lawful to the Children of Israel except what Israel [i.e., Jacob] had made unlawful to himself before the Torah was revealed. Say, [O Muḥammad], \"So bring the Torah and recite it, if you should be truthful.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "كُلُّ", "translit": "ُّlُk", "root": "كلل"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلطَّعَامِ", "translit": "ِmāَʿعَّṭlٱ", "root": "طعم"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "كَانَ", "translit": "َnāَk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "حِلًّا", "translit": "āًّlِḥ", "root": "حلل"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "لِّبَنِىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِnَbِّl", "root": "بني"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ", "translit": "َlyِءَٰٓrْsِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "حَرَّمَ", "translit": "َmَّrَḥ", "root": "حرم"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "إِسْرَٰٓءِيلُ", "translit": "ُlyِءَٰٓrْsِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "عَلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "نَفْسِهِۦ", "translit": "ۦِhِsْfَn", "root": "نفس"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "مِن", "translit": "nِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "قَبْلِ", "translit": "ِlْbَq", "root": "قبل"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "أَن", "translit": "nَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "تُنَزَّلَ", "translit": "َlَّzَnُt", "root": "نزل"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "ٱلتَّوْرَىٰةُ", "translit": "ُẗٰàَrْwَّtlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "قُلْ", "translit": "ْlُq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "فَأْتُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُtْaʾَf", "root": "اتي"}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "بِٱلتَّوْرَىٰةِ", "translit": "ِẗٰàَrْwَّtlٱِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "فَٱتْلُوهَآ", "translit": "ٓāَhwُlْtٱَf", "root": "تلو"}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "إِن", "translit": "nِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "كُنتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtnُk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 24, "arabic": "صَٰدِقِينَ", "translit": "َnyِqِdَٰṣ", "root": "صدق"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 94, "text": "فَمَنِ ٱفْتَرَىٰ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ ٱلْكَذِبَ مِنۢ بَعْدِ ذَٰلِكَ فَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلظَّٰلِمُونَ ", "translation": "And whoever invents about Allāh untruth after that - then those are [truly] the wrongdoers.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَمَنِ", "translit": "ِnَmَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱفْتَرَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَrَtْfٱ", "root": "فري"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "عَلَى", "translit": "àَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلْكَذِبَ", "translit": "َbِhdَkْlٱ", "root": "كذب"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "مِنۢ", "translit": "ۢnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "بَعْدِ", "translit": "ِdْʿعَb", "root": "بعد"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translit": "َkِlَٰhd", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "فَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ", "translit": "َkِyʾَٰٓl۟wُaʾَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "هُمُ", "translit": "ُmُh", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ٱلظَّٰلِمُونَ", "translit": "َnwُmِlَّٰẓlٱ", "root": "ظلم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 95, "text": "قُلْ صَدَقَ ٱللَّهُۗ فَٱتَّبِعُوا۟ مِلَّةَ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ حَنِيفًا وَمَا كَانَ مِنَ ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ ", "translation": "Say, \"Allāh has told the truth. So follow the religion of Abraham, inclining toward truth; and he was not of the polytheists.\"[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قُلْ", "translit": "ْlُq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "صَدَقَ", "translit": "َqَdَṣ", "root": "صدق"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "فَٱتَّبِعُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُʿعِbَّtٱَf", "root": "تبع"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "مِلَّةَ", "translit": "َẗَّlِm", "root": "ملل"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "إِبْرَٰهِيمَ", "translit": "َmyِhَٰrْbِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "حَنِيفًا", "translit": "āًfyِnَḥ", "root": "حنف"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "كَانَ", "translit": "َnāَk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ", "translit": "َnyِkِrْhsُmْlٱ", "root": "شرك"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 96, "text": "إِنَّ أَوَّلَ بَيْتٍ وُضِعَ لِلنَّاسِ لَلَّذِى بِبَكَّةَ مُبَارَكًا وَهُدًى لِّلْعَٰلَمِينَ ", "translation": "Indeed, the first House [of worship] established for mankind was that at Bakkah [i.e., Makkah] - blessed and a guidance for the worlds.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَوَّلَ", "translit": "َlَّwَaʾ", "root": "اول"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "بَيْتٍ", "translit": "ٍtْyَb", "root": "بيت"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "وُضِعَ", "translit": "َʿعِḍُw", "root": "وضع"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "لِلنَّاسِ", "translit": "ِsāَّnlِl", "root": "انس"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "لَلَّذِى", "translit": "àِhdَّlَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "بِبَكَّةَ", "translit": "َẗَّkَbِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "مُبَارَكًا", "translit": "āًkَrāَbُm", "root": "برك"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "وَهُدًى", "translit": "àًdُhَw", "root": "هدي"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "لِّلْعَٰلَمِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmَlَٰʿعْlِّl", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 97, "text": "فِيهِ ءَايَٰتٌۢ بَيِّنَٰتٌ مَّقَامُ إِبْرَٰهِيمَۖ وَمَن دَخَلَهُۥ كَانَ ءَامِنًاۗ وَلِلَّهِ عَلَى ٱلنَّاسِ حِجُّ ٱلْبَيْتِ مَنِ ٱسْتَطَاعَ إِلَيْهِ سَبِيلًاۚ وَمَن كَفَرَ فَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ غَنِىٌّ عَنِ ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ ", "translation": "In it are clear signs [such as] the standing place of Abraham. And whoever enters it [i.e., the Ḥaram] shall be safe. And [due] to Allāh from the people is a pilgrimage to the House - for whoever is able to find thereto a way. But whoever disbelieves [i.e., refuses] - then indeed, Allāh is free from need of the worlds.[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فِيهِ", "translit": "ِhyِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ءَايَٰتٌۢ", "translit": "ٌۢtَٰyāَء", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "بَيِّنَٰتٌ", "translit": "ٌtَٰnِّyَb", "root": "بين"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مَّقَامُ", "translit": "ُmāَqَّm", "root": "قوم"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "إِبْرَٰهِيمَ", "translit": "َmyِhَٰrْbِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "وَمَن", "translit": "nَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "دَخَلَهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَlَhkَd", "root": "دخل"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "كَانَ", "translit": "َnāَk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "ءَامِنًا", "translit": "āًnِmāَء", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "وَلِلَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّlِlَw", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "عَلَى", "translit": "àَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "ٱلنَّاسِ", "translit": "ِsāَّnlٱ", "root": "انس"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "حِجُّ", "translit": "ُّjgِḥ", "root": "حجج"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "ٱلْبَيْتِ", "translit": "ِtْyَbْlٱ", "root": "بيت"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "مَنِ", "translit": "ِnَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "ٱسْتَطَاعَ", "translit": "َʿعāَṭَtْsٱ", "root": "طوع"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "إِلَيْهِ", "translit": "ِhْyَlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "سَبِيلًا", "translit": "āًlyِbَs", "root": "سبل"}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "وَمَن", "translit": "nَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "كَفَرَ", "translit": "َrَfَk", "root": "كفر"}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "فَإِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "غَنِىٌّ", "translit": "ٌّàِnَغ", "root": "غني"}, {"id": 24, "arabic": "عَنِ", "translit": "ِnَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 25, "arabic": "ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmَlَٰʿعْlٱ", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 98, "text": "قُلْ يَٰٓأَهْلَ ٱلْكِتَٰبِ لِمَ تَكْفُرُونَ بِـَٔايَٰتِ ٱللَّهِ وَٱللَّهُ شَهِيدٌ عَلَىٰ مَا تَعْمَلُونَ ", "translation": "Say, \"O People of the Scripture, why do you disbelieve in the verses of Allāh while Allāh is Witness over what you do?\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قُلْ", "translit": "ْlُq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "يَٰٓأَهْلَ", "translit": "َlْhَaʾَٰٓy", "root": "اهل"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلْكِتَٰبِ", "translit": "ِbَٰtِkْlٱ", "root": "كتب"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "لِمَ", "translit": "َmِl", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "تَكْفُرُونَ", "translit": "َnwُrُfْkَt", "root": "كفر"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "بِـَٔايَٰتِ", "translit": "ِtَٰyāَٔـِb", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱَw", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "شَهِيدٌ", "translit": "ٌdyِhَhs", "root": "شهد"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "عَلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "تَعْمَلُونَ", "translit": "َnwُlَmْʿعَt", "root": "عمل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 99, "text": "قُلْ يَٰٓأَهْلَ ٱلْكِتَٰبِ لِمَ تَصُدُّونَ عَن سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ مَنْ ءَامَنَ تَبْغُونَهَا عِوَجًا وَأَنتُمْ شُهَدَآءُۗ وَمَا ٱللَّهُ بِغَٰفِلٍ عَمَّا تَعْمَلُونَ ", "translation": "Say, \"O People of the Scripture, why do you avert from the way of Allāh those who believe, seeking to make it [seem] deviant, while you are witnesses [to the truth]? And Allāh is not unaware of what you do.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قُلْ", "translit": "ْlُq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "يَٰٓأَهْلَ", "translit": "َlْhَaʾَٰٓy", "root": "اهل"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلْكِتَٰبِ", "translit": "ِbَٰtِkْlٱ", "root": "كتب"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "لِمَ", "translit": "َmِl", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "تَصُدُّونَ", "translit": "َnwُّdُṣَt", "root": "صدد"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "عَن", "translit": "nَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "سَبِيلِ", "translit": "ِlyِbَs", "root": "سبل"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "مَنْ", "translit": "ْnَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "ءَامَنَ", "translit": "َnَmāَء", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "تَبْغُونَهَا", "translit": "āَhَnwُغْbَt", "root": "بغي"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "عِوَجًا", "translit": "āًjgَwِʿع", "root": "عوج"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "وَأَنتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtnَaʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "شُهَدَآءُ", "translit": "ُءٓāَdَhُhs", "root": "شهد"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "ٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "بِغَٰفِلٍ", "translit": "ٍlِfَٰغِb", "root": "غفل"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "عَمَّا", "translit": "āَّmَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "تَعْمَلُونَ", "translit": "َnwُlَmْʿعَt", "root": "عمل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 100, "text": "يَٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوٓا۟ إِن تُطِيعُوا۟ فَرِيقًا مِّنَ ٱلَّذِينَ أُوتُوا۟ ٱلْكِتَٰبَ يَرُدُّوكُم بَعْدَ إِيمَٰنِكُمْ كَٰفِرِينَ ", "translation": "O you who have believed, if you obey a party of those who were given the Scripture, they would turn you back, after your belief, [to being] unbelievers.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "يَٰٓأَيُّهَا", "translit": "āَhُّyَaʾَٰٓy", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translit": "َnyِhdَّlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ءَامَنُوٓا۟", "translit": "۟āٓwُnَmāَء", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "إِن", "translit": "nِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "تُطِيعُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُʿعyِṭُt", "root": "طوع"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "فَرِيقًا", "translit": "āًqyِrَf", "root": "فرق"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "مِّنَ", "translit": "َnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translit": "َnyِhdَّlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "أُوتُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُtwُaʾ", "root": "اتي"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "ٱلْكِتَٰبَ", "translit": "َbَٰtِkْlٱ", "root": "كتب"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "يَرُدُّوكُم", "translit": "mُkwُّdُrَy", "root": "ردد"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "بَعْدَ", "translit": "َdْʿعَb", "root": "بعد"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "إِيمَٰنِكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkِnَٰmyِiʾ", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "كَٰفِرِينَ", "translit": "َnyِrِfَٰk", "root": "كفر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 101, "text": "وَكَيْفَ تَكْفُرُونَ وَأَنتُمْ تُتْلَىٰ عَلَيْكُمْ ءَايَٰتُ ٱللَّهِ وَفِيكُمْ رَسُولُهُۥۗ وَمَن يَعْتَصِم بِٱللَّهِ فَقَدْ هُدِىَ إِلَىٰ صِرَٰطٍ مُّسْتَقِيمٍ ", "translation": "And how could you disbelieve while to you are being recited the verses of Allāh and among you is His Messenger? And whoever holds firmly to Allāh[1] has [indeed] been guided to a straight path.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَكَيْفَ", "translit": "َfْyَkَw", "root": "كيف"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "تَكْفُرُونَ", "translit": "َnwُrُfْkَt", "root": "كفر"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَأَنتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtnَaʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "تُتْلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlْtُt", "root": "تلو"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "عَلَيْكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ءَايَٰتُ", "translit": "ُtَٰyāَء", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "وَفِيكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkyِfَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "رَسُولُهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhُlwُsَr", "root": "رسل"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "وَمَن", "translit": "nَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "يَعْتَصِم", "translit": "mِṣَtْʿعَy", "root": "عصم"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "بِٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱِb", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "فَقَدْ", "translit": "ْdَqَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "هُدِىَ", "translit": "َàِdُh", "root": "هدي"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "إِلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "صِرَٰطٍ", "translit": "ٍṭَٰrِṣ", "root": "صرط"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "مُّسْتَقِيمٍ", "translit": "ٍmyِqَtْsُّm", "root": "قوم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 102, "text": "يَٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ ٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ حَقَّ تُقَاتِهِۦ وَلَا تَمُوتُنَّ إِلَّا وَأَنتُم مُّسْلِمُونَ ", "translation": "O you who have believed, fear Allāh as He should be feared and do not die except as Muslims [in submission to Him].", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "يَٰٓأَيُّهَا", "translit": "āَhُّyَaʾَٰٓy", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translit": "َnyِhdَّlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ءَامَنُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُnَmāَء", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱتَّقُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُqَّtٱ", "root": "وقي"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "حَقَّ", "translit": "َّqَḥ", "root": "حقق"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "تُقَاتِهِۦ", "translit": "ۦِhِtāَqُt", "root": "وقي"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "وَلَا", "translit": "āَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "تَمُوتُنَّ", "translit": "َّnُtwُmَt", "root": "موت"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "وَأَنتُم", "translit": "mُtnَaʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "مُّسْلِمُونَ", "translit": "َnwُmِlْsُّm", "root": "سلم"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 103, "text": "وَٱعْتَصِمُوا۟ بِحَبْلِ ٱللَّهِ جَمِيعًا وَلَا تَفَرَّقُوا۟ۚ وَٱذْكُرُوا۟ نِعْمَتَ ٱللَّهِ عَلَيْكُمْ إِذْ كُنتُمْ أَعْدَآءً فَأَلَّفَ بَيْنَ قُلُوبِكُمْ فَأَصْبَحْتُم بِنِعْمَتِهِۦٓ إِخْوَٰنًا وَكُنتُمْ عَلَىٰ شَفَا حُفْرَةٍ مِّنَ ٱلنَّارِ فَأَنقَذَكُم مِّنْهَاۗ كَذَٰلِكَ يُبَيِّنُ ٱللَّهُ لَكُمْ ءَايَٰتِهِۦ لَعَلَّكُمْ تَهْتَدُونَ ", "translation": "And hold firmly to the rope[1] of Allāh all together and do not become divided. And remember the favor of Allāh upon you - when you were enemies and He brought your hearts together and you became, by His favor, brothers. And you were on the edge of a pit of the Fire, and He saved you from it. Thus does Allāh make clear to you His verses that you may be guided.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَٱعْتَصِمُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُmِṣَtْʿعٱَw", "root": "عصم"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "بِحَبْلِ", "translit": "ِlْbَḥِb", "root": "حبل"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "جَمِيعًا", "translit": "āًʿعyِmَjg", "root": "جمع"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَلَا", "translit": "āَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "تَفَرَّقُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُqَّrَfَt", "root": "فرق"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "وَٱذْكُرُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُrُkْhdٱَw", "root": "ذكر"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "نِعْمَتَ", "translit": "َtَmْʿعِn", "root": "نعم"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "عَلَيْكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "إِذْ", "translit": "ْhdِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "كُنتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtnُk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "أَعْدَآءً", "translit": "ًءٓāَdْʿعَaʾ", "root": "عدو"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "فَأَلَّفَ", "translit": "َfَّlَaʾَf", "root": "الف"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "بَيْنَ", "translit": "َnْyَb", "root": "بين"}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "قُلُوبِكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkِbwُlُq", "root": "قلب"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "فَأَصْبَحْتُم", "translit": "mُtْḥَbْṣَaʾَf", "root": "صبح"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "بِنِعْمَتِهِۦٓ", "translit": "ٓۦِhِtَmْʿعِnِb", "root": "نعم"}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "إِخْوَٰنًا", "translit": "āًnَٰwْhkِiʾ", "root": "اخو"}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "وَكُنتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtnُkَw", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "عَلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "شَفَا", "translit": "āَfَhs", "root": "شفو"}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "حُفْرَةٍ", "translit": "ٍẗَrْfُḥ", "root": "حفر"}, {"id": 24, "arabic": "مِّنَ", "translit": "َnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 25, "arabic": "ٱلنَّارِ", "translit": "ِrāَّnlٱ", "root": "نور"}, {"id": 26, "arabic": "فَأَنقَذَكُم", "translit": "mُkَhdَqnَaʾَf", "root": "نقذ"}, {"id": 27, "arabic": "مِّنْهَا", "translit": "āَhْnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 28, "arabic": "كَذَٰلِكَ", "translit": "َkِlَٰhdَk", "root": ""}, {"id": 29, "arabic": "يُبَيِّنُ", "translit": "ُnِّyَbُy", "root": "بين"}, {"id": 30, "arabic": "ٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 31, "arabic": "لَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 32, "arabic": "ءَايَٰتِهِۦ", "translit": "ۦِhِtَٰyāَء", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 33, "arabic": "لَعَلَّكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَّlَʿعَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 34, "arabic": "تَهْتَدُونَ", "translit": "َnwُdَtْhَt", "root": "هدي"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 104, "text": "وَلْتَكُن مِّنكُمْ أُمَّةٌ يَدْعُونَ إِلَى ٱلْخَيْرِ وَيَأْمُرُونَ بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ وَيَنْهَوْنَ عَنِ ٱلْمُنكَرِۚ وَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلْمُفْلِحُونَ ", "translation": "And let there be [arising] from you a nation inviting to [all that is] good, enjoining what is right and forbidding what is wrong,[1] and those will be the successful.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَلْتَكُن", "translit": "nُkَtْlَw", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مِّنكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُknِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أُمَّةٌ", "translit": "ٌẗَّmُaʾ", "root": "امم"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "يَدْعُونَ", "translit": "َnwُʿعْdَy", "root": "دعو"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "إِلَى", "translit": "àَlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱلْخَيْرِ", "translit": "ِrْyَhkْlٱ", "root": "خير"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "وَيَأْمُرُونَ", "translit": "َnwُrُmْaʾَyَw", "root": "امر"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ", "translit": "ِfwُrْʿعَmْlٱِb", "root": "عرف"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "وَيَنْهَوْنَ", "translit": "َnْwَhْnَyَw", "root": "نهي"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "عَنِ", "translit": "ِnَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ٱلْمُنكَرِ", "translit": "ِrَknُmْlٱ", "root": "نكر"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "وَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ", "translit": "َkِyʾَٰٓl۟wُaʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "هُمُ", "translit": "ُmُh", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "ٱلْمُفْلِحُونَ", "translit": "َnwُḥِlْfُmْlٱ", "root": "فلح"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 105, "text": "وَلَا تَكُونُوا۟ كَٱلَّذِينَ تَفَرَّقُوا۟ وَٱخْتَلَفُوا۟ مِنۢ بَعْدِ مَا جَآءَهُمُ ٱلْبَيِّنَٰتُۚ وَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ لَهُمْ عَذَابٌ عَظِيمٌ ", "translation": "And do not be like the ones who became divided and differed after the clear proofs had come to them. And those will have a great punishment", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَلَا", "translit": "āَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "تَكُونُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُnwُkَt", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "كَٱلَّذِينَ", "translit": "َnyِhdَّlٱَk", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "تَفَرَّقُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُqَّrَfَt", "root": "فرق"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَٱخْتَلَفُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُfَlَtْhkٱَw", "root": "خلف"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "مِنۢ", "translit": "ۢnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "بَعْدِ", "translit": "ِdْʿعَb", "root": "بعد"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "جَآءَهُمُ", "translit": "ُmُhَءٓāَjg", "root": "جيا"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "ٱلْبَيِّنَٰتُ", "translit": "ُtَٰnِّyَbْlٱ", "root": "بين"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "وَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ", "translit": "َkِyʾَٰٓl۟wُaʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "لَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "عَذَابٌ", "translit": "ٌbāَhdَʿع", "root": "عذب"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "عَظِيمٌ", "translit": "ٌmyِẓَʿع", "root": "عظم"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 106, "text": "يَوْمَ تَبْيَضُّ وُجُوهٌ وَتَسْوَدُّ وُجُوهٌۚ فَأَمَّا ٱلَّذِينَ ٱسْوَدَّتْ وُجُوهُهُمْ أَكَفَرْتُم بَعْدَ إِيمَٰنِكُمْ فَذُوقُوا۟ ٱلْعَذَابَ بِمَا كُنتُمْ تَكْفُرُونَ ", "translation": "On the Day [some] faces will turn white and [some] faces will turn black. As for those whose faces turn black, [to them it will be said], \"Did you disbelieve [i.e., reject faith] after your belief? Then taste the punishment for what you used to reject.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "يَوْمَ", "translit": "َmْwَy", "root": "يوم"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "تَبْيَضُّ", "translit": "ُّḍَyْbَt", "root": "بيض"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وُجُوهٌ", "translit": "ٌhwُjgُw", "root": "وجه"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "وَتَسْوَدُّ", "translit": "ُّdَwْsَtَw", "root": "سود"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وُجُوهٌ", "translit": "ٌhwُjgُw", "root": "وجه"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "فَأَمَّا", "translit": "āَّmَaʾَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translit": "َnyِhdَّlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "ٱسْوَدَّتْ", "translit": "ْtَّdَwْsٱ", "root": "سود"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "وُجُوهُهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhُhwُjgُw", "root": "وجه"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "أَكَفَرْتُم", "translit": "mُtْrَfَkَaʾ", "root": "كفر"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "بَعْدَ", "translit": "َdْʿعَb", "root": "بعد"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "إِيمَٰنِكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkِnَٰmyِiʾ", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "فَذُوقُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُqwُhdَf", "root": "ذوق"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "ٱلْعَذَابَ", "translit": "َbāَhdَʿعْlٱ", "root": "عذب"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "بِمَا", "translit": "āَmِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "كُنتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtnُk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "تَكْفُرُونَ", "translit": "َnwُrُfْkَt", "root": "كفر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 107, "text": "وَأَمَّا ٱلَّذِينَ ٱبْيَضَّتْ وُجُوهُهُمْ فَفِى رَحْمَةِ ٱللَّهِ هُمْ فِيهَا خَٰلِدُونَ ", "translation": "But as for those whose faces turn white, [they will be] within the mercy of Allāh. They will abide therein eternally.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَأَمَّا", "translit": "āَّmَaʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translit": "َnyِhdَّlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱبْيَضَّتْ", "translit": "ْtَّḍَyْbٱ", "root": "بيض"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "وُجُوهُهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhُhwُjgُw", "root": "وجه"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "فَفِى", "translit": "àِfَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "رَحْمَةِ", "translit": "ِẗَmْḥَr", "root": "رحم"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "هُمْ", "translit": "ْmُh", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "فِيهَا", "translit": "āَhyِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "خَٰلِدُونَ", "translit": "َnwُdِlَٰhk", "root": "خلد"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 108, "text": "تِلْكَ ءَايَٰتُ ٱللَّهِ نَتْلُوهَا عَلَيْكَ بِٱلْحَقِّۗ وَمَا ٱللَّهُ يُرِيدُ ظُلْمًا لِّلْعَٰلَمِينَ ", "translation": "These are the verses of Allāh. We recite them to you, [O Muḥammad], in truth; and Allāh wants no injustice to the worlds [i.e., His creatures].", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "تِلْكَ", "translit": "َkْlِt", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ءَايَٰتُ", "translit": "ُtَٰyāَء", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "نَتْلُوهَا", "translit": "āَhwُlْtَn", "root": "تلو"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "عَلَيْكَ", "translit": "َkْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "بِٱلْحَقِّ", "translit": "ِّqَḥْlٱِb", "root": "حقق"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "ٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "يُرِيدُ", "translit": "ُdyِrُy", "root": "رود"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "ظُلْمًا", "translit": "āًmْlُẓ", "root": "ظلم"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "لِّلْعَٰلَمِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmَlَٰʿعْlِّl", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 109, "text": "وَلِلَّهِ مَا فِى ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ وَمَا فِى ٱلْأَرْضِۚ وَإِلَى ٱللَّهِ تُرْجَعُ ٱلْأُمُورُ ", "translation": "To Allāh belongs whatever is in the heavens and whatever is on the earth. And to Allāh will [all] matters be returned.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَلِلَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّlِlَw", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ", "translit": "ِtَٰwَٰmَّslٱ", "root": "سمو"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱلْأَرْضِ", "translit": "ِḍْrَaʾْlٱ", "root": "ارض"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "وَإِلَى", "translit": "àَlِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "تُرْجَعُ", "translit": "ُʿعَjgْrُt", "root": "رجع"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ٱلْأُمُورُ", "translit": "ُrwُmُaʾْlٱ", "root": "امر"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 110, "text": "كُنتُمْ خَيْرَ أُمَّةٍ أُخْرِجَتْ لِلنَّاسِ تَأْمُرُونَ بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ وَتَنْهَوْنَ عَنِ ٱلْمُنكَرِ وَتُؤْمِنُونَ بِٱللَّهِۗ وَلَوْ ءَامَنَ أَهْلُ ٱلْكِتَٰبِ لَكَانَ خَيْرًا لَّهُمۚ مِّنْهُمُ ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ وَأَكْثَرُهُمُ ٱلْفَٰسِقُونَ ", "translation": "You are the best nation produced [as an example] for mankind. You enjoin what is right and forbid what is wrong and believe in Allāh. If only the People of the Scripture had believed, it would have been better for them. Among them are believers, but most of them are defiantly disobedient.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "كُنتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtnُk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "خَيْرَ", "translit": "َrْyَhk", "root": "خير"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أُمَّةٍ", "translit": "ٍẗَّmُaʾ", "root": "امم"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أُخْرِجَتْ", "translit": "ْtَjgِrْhkُaʾ", "root": "خرج"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "لِلنَّاسِ", "translit": "ِsāَّnlِl", "root": "انس"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "تَأْمُرُونَ", "translit": "َnwُrُmْaʾَt", "root": "امر"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ", "translit": "ِfwُrْʿعَmْlٱِb", "root": "عرف"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "وَتَنْهَوْنَ", "translit": "َnْwَhْnَtَw", "root": "نهي"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "عَنِ", "translit": "ِnَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "ٱلْمُنكَرِ", "translit": "ِrَknُmْlٱ", "root": "نكر"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "وَتُؤْمِنُونَ", "translit": "َnwُnِmْwʾُtَw", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "بِٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱِb", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "وَلَوْ", "translit": "ْwَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "ءَامَنَ", "translit": "َnَmāَء", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "أَهْلُ", "translit": "ُlْhَaʾ", "root": "اهل"}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "ٱلْكِتَٰبِ", "translit": "ِbَٰtِkْlٱ", "root": "كتب"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "لَكَانَ", "translit": "َnāَkَl", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "خَيْرًا", "translit": "āًrْyَhk", "root": "خير"}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "لَّهُم", "translit": "mُhَّl", "root": ""}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "مِّنْهُمُ", "translit": "ُmُhْnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ", "translit": "َnwُnِmْwʾُmْlٱ", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "وَأَكْثَرُهُمُ", "translit": "ُmُhُrَhtْkَaʾَw", "root": "كثر"}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "ٱلْفَٰسِقُونَ", "translit": "َnwُqِsَٰfْlٱ", "root": "فسق"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 111, "text": "لَن يَضُرُّوكُمْ إِلَّآ أَذًىۖ وَإِن يُقَٰتِلُوكُمْ يُوَلُّوكُمُ ٱلْأَدْبَارَ ثُمَّ لَا يُنصَرُونَ ", "translation": "They will not harm you except for [some] annoyance. And if they fight you, they will show you their backs [i.e., retreat]; then they will not be aided.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "لَن", "translit": "nَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "يَضُرُّوكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkwُّrُḍَy", "root": "ضرر"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "إِلَّآ", "translit": "ٓāَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَذًى", "translit": "àًhdَaʾ", "root": "اذي"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَإِن", "translit": "nِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "يُقَٰتِلُوكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkwُlِtَٰqُy", "root": "قتل"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "يُوَلُّوكُمُ", "translit": "ُmُkwُّlَwُy", "root": "ولي"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "ٱلْأَدْبَارَ", "translit": "َrāَbْdَaʾْlٱ", "root": "دبر"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "ثُمَّ", "translit": "َّmُht", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "لَا", "translit": "āَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "يُنصَرُونَ", "translit": "َnwُrَṣnُy", "root": "نصر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 112, "text": "ضُرِبَتْ عَلَيْهِمُ ٱلذِّلَّةُ أَيْنَ مَا ثُقِفُوٓا۟ إِلَّا بِحَبْلٍ مِّنَ ٱللَّهِ وَحَبْلٍ مِّنَ ٱلنَّاسِ وَبَآءُو بِغَضَبٍ مِّنَ ٱللَّهِ وَضُرِبَتْ عَلَيْهِمُ ٱلْمَسْكَنَةُۚ ذَٰلِكَ بِأَنَّهُمْ كَانُوا۟ يَكْفُرُونَ بِـَٔايَٰتِ ٱللَّهِ وَيَقْتُلُونَ ٱلْأَنۢبِيَآءَ بِغَيْرِ حَقٍّۚ ذَٰلِكَ بِمَا عَصَوا۟ وَّكَانُوا۟ يَعْتَدُونَ ", "translation": "They have been put under humiliation [by Allāh] wherever they are overtaken, except for a rope [i.e., covenant] from Allāh and a rope [i.e., treaty] from the people [i.e., the Muslims].[1] And they have drawn upon themselves anger from Allāh and have been put under destitution. That is because they disbelieved in [i.e., rejected] the verses of Allāh and killed the prophets without right. That is because they disobeyed and [habitually] transgressed.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "ضُرِبَتْ", "translit": "ْtَbِrُḍ", "root": "ضرب"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "عَلَيْهِمُ", "translit": "ُmِhْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلذِّلَّةُ", "translit": "ُẗَّlِّhdlٱ", "root": "ذلل"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَيْنَ", "translit": "َnْyَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ثُقِفُوٓا۟", "translit": "۟āٓwُfِqُht", "root": "ثقف"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "بِحَبْلٍ", "translit": "ٍlْbَḥِb", "root": "حبل"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "مِّنَ", "translit": "َnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "وَحَبْلٍ", "translit": "ٍlْbَḥَw", "root": "حبل"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "مِّنَ", "translit": "َnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "ٱلنَّاسِ", "translit": "ِsāَّnlٱ", "root": "انس"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "وَبَآءُو", "translit": "wُءٓāَbَw", "root": "بوا"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "بِغَضَبٍ", "translit": "ٍbَḍَغِb", "root": "غضب"}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "مِّنَ", "translit": "َnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "وَضُرِبَتْ", "translit": "ْtَbِrُḍَw", "root": "ضرب"}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "عَلَيْهِمُ", "translit": "ُmِhْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "ٱلْمَسْكَنَةُ", "translit": "ُẗَnَkْsَmْlٱ", "root": "سكن"}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translit": "َkِlَٰhd", "root": ""}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "بِأَنَّهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَّnَaʾِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "كَانُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُnāَk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 24, "arabic": "يَكْفُرُونَ", "translit": "َnwُrُfْkَy", "root": "كفر"}, {"id": 25, "arabic": "بِـَٔايَٰتِ", "translit": "ِtَٰyāَٔـِb", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 26, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 27, "arabic": "وَيَقْتُلُونَ", "translit": "َnwُlُtْqَyَw", "root": "قتل"}, {"id": 28, "arabic": "ٱلْأَنۢبِيَآءَ", "translit": "َءٓāَyِbۢnَaʾْlٱ", "root": "نبا"}, {"id": 29, "arabic": "بِغَيْرِ", "translit": "ِrْyَغِb", "root": "غير"}, {"id": 30, "arabic": "حَقٍّ", "translit": "ٍّqَḥ", "root": "حقق"}, {"id": 31, "arabic": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translit": "َkِlَٰhd", "root": ""}, {"id": 32, "arabic": "بِمَا", "translit": "āَmِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 33, "arabic": "عَصَوا۟", "translit": "۟āwَṣَʿع", "root": "عصي"}, {"id": 34, "arabic": "وَّكَانُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُnāَkَّw", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 35, "arabic": "يَعْتَدُونَ", "translit": "َnwُdَtْʿعَy", "root": "عدو"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 113, "text": "لَيْسُوا۟ سَوَآءًۗ مِّنْ أَهْلِ ٱلْكِتَٰبِ أُمَّةٌ قَآئِمَةٌ يَتْلُونَ ءَايَٰتِ ٱللَّهِ ءَانَآءَ ٱلَّيْلِ وَهُمْ يَسْجُدُونَ ", "translation": "They are not [all] the same; among the People of the Scripture is a community[1] standing [in obedience], reciting the verses of Allāh during periods of the night and prostrating [in prayer].", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "لَيْسُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُsْyَl", "root": "ليس"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "سَوَآءً", "translit": "ًءٓāَwَs", "root": "سوي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مِّنْ", "translit": "ْnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَهْلِ", "translit": "ِlْhَaʾ", "root": "اهل"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلْكِتَٰبِ", "translit": "ِbَٰtِkْlٱ", "root": "كتب"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "أُمَّةٌ", "translit": "ٌẗَّmُaʾ", "root": "امم"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "قَآئِمَةٌ", "translit": "ٌẗَmِyʾٓāَq", "root": "قوم"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "يَتْلُونَ", "translit": "َnwُlْtَy", "root": "تلو"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "ءَايَٰتِ", "translit": "ِtَٰyāَء", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ءَانَآءَ", "translit": "َءٓāَnāَء", "root": "اني"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "ٱلَّيْلِ", "translit": "ِlْyَّlٱ", "root": "ليل"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "وَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "يَسْجُدُونَ", "translit": "َnwُdُjgْsَy", "root": "سجد"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 114, "text": "يُؤْمِنُونَ بِٱللَّهِ وَٱلْيَوْمِ ٱلْءَاخِرِ وَيَأْمُرُونَ بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ وَيَنْهَوْنَ عَنِ ٱلْمُنكَرِ وَيُسَٰرِعُونَ فِى ٱلْخَيْرَٰتِ وَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ مِنَ ٱلصَّٰلِحِينَ ", "translation": "They believe in Allāh and the Last Day, and they enjoin what is right and forbid what is wrong and hasten to good deeds. And those are among the righteous.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "يُؤْمِنُونَ", "translit": "َnwُnِmْwʾُy", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "بِٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱِb", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَٱلْيَوْمِ", "translit": "ِmْwَyْlٱَw", "root": "يوم"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْءَاخِرِ", "translit": "ِrِhkāَءْlٱ", "root": "اخر"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَيَأْمُرُونَ", "translit": "َnwُrُmْaʾَyَw", "root": "امر"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ", "translit": "ِfwُrْʿعَmْlٱِb", "root": "عرف"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "وَيَنْهَوْنَ", "translit": "َnْwَhْnَyَw", "root": "نهي"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "عَنِ", "translit": "ِnَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "ٱلْمُنكَرِ", "translit": "ِrَknُmْlٱ", "root": "نكر"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "وَيُسَٰرِعُونَ", "translit": "َnwُʿعِrَٰsُyَw", "root": "سرع"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "ٱلْخَيْرَٰتِ", "translit": "ِtَٰrْyَhkْlٱ", "root": "خير"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "وَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ", "translit": "َkِyʾَٰٓl۟wُaʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "ٱلصَّٰلِحِينَ", "translit": "َnyِḥِlَّٰṣlٱ", "root": "صلح"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 115, "text": "وَمَا يَفْعَلُوا۟ مِنْ خَيْرٍ فَلَن يُكْفَرُوهُۗ وَٱللَّهُ عَلِيمٌۢ بِٱلْمُتَّقِينَ ", "translation": "And whatever good they do - never will it be denied them. And Allāh is Knowing of the righteous.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "يَفْعَلُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُlَʿعْfَy", "root": "فعل"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مِنْ", "translit": "ْnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "خَيْرٍ", "translit": "ٍrْyَhk", "root": "خير"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "فَلَن", "translit": "nَlَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "يُكْفَرُوهُ", "translit": "ُhwُrَfْkُy", "root": "كفر"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱَw", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "عَلِيمٌۢ", "translit": "ٌۢmyِlَʿع", "root": "علم"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "بِٱلْمُتَّقِينَ", "translit": "َnyِqَّtُmْlٱِb", "root": "وقي"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 116, "text": "إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ لَن تُغْنِىَ عَنْهُمْ أَمْوَٰلُهُمْ وَلَآ أَوْلَٰدُهُم مِّنَ ٱللَّهِ شَيْـًٔاۖ وَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ أَصْحَٰبُ ٱلنَّارِۚ هُمْ فِيهَا خَٰلِدُونَ ", "translation": "Indeed, those who disbelieve - never will their wealth or their children avail them against Allāh at all, and those are the companions of the Fire; they will abide therein eternally.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translit": "َnyِhdَّlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "كَفَرُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُrَfَk", "root": "كفر"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "لَن", "translit": "nَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "تُغْنِىَ", "translit": "َàِnْغُt", "root": "غني"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "عَنْهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhْnَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "أَمْوَٰلُهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhُlَٰwْmَaʾ", "root": "مول"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "وَلَآ", "translit": "ٓāَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "أَوْلَٰدُهُم", "translit": "mُhُdَٰlْwَaʾ", "root": "ولد"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "مِّنَ", "translit": "َnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "شَيْـًٔا", "translit": "āًٔـْyَhs", "root": "شيا"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "وَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ", "translit": "َkِyʾَٰٓl۟wُaʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "أَصْحَٰبُ", "translit": "ُbَٰḥْṣَaʾ", "root": "صحب"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "ٱلنَّارِ", "translit": "ِrāَّnlٱ", "root": "نور"}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "هُمْ", "translit": "ْmُh", "root": ""}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "فِيهَا", "translit": "āَhyِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "خَٰلِدُونَ", "translit": "َnwُdِlَٰhk", "root": "خلد"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 117, "text": "مَثَلُ مَا يُنفِقُونَ فِى هَٰذِهِ ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنْيَا كَمَثَلِ رِيحٍ فِيهَا صِرٌّ أَصَابَتْ حَرْثَ قَوْمٍ ظَلَمُوٓا۟ أَنفُسَهُمْ فَأَهْلَكَتْهُۚ وَمَا ظَلَمَهُمُ ٱللَّهُ وَلَٰكِنْ أَنفُسَهُمْ يَظْلِمُونَ ", "translation": "The example of what they spend in this worldly life is like that of a wind containing frost which strikes the harvest of a people who have wronged themselves [i.e., sinned] and destroys it. And Allāh has not wronged them, but they wrong themselves.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "مَثَلُ", "translit": "ُlَhtَm", "root": "مثل"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "يُنفِقُونَ", "translit": "َnwُqِfnُy", "root": "نفق"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "هَٰذِهِ", "translit": "ِhِhdَٰh", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ", "translit": "ِẗٰwَyَḥْlٱ", "root": "حيي"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱلدُّنْيَا", "translit": "āَyْnُّdlٱ", "root": "دنو"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "كَمَثَلِ", "translit": "ِlَhtَmَk", "root": "مثل"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "رِيحٍ", "translit": "ٍḥyِr", "root": "روح"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "فِيهَا", "translit": "āَhyِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "صِرٌّ", "translit": "ٌّrِṣ", "root": "صرر"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "أَصَابَتْ", "translit": "ْtَbāَṣَaʾ", "root": "صوب"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "حَرْثَ", "translit": "َhtْrَḥ", "root": "حرث"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "قَوْمٍ", "translit": "ٍmْwَq", "root": "قوم"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "ظَلَمُوٓا۟", "translit": "۟āٓwُmَlَẓ", "root": "ظلم"}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "أَنفُسَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَsُfnَaʾ", "root": "نفس"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "فَأَهْلَكَتْهُ", "translit": "ُhْtَkَlْhَaʾَf", "root": "هلك"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "ظَلَمَهُمُ", "translit": "ُmُhَmَlَẓ", "root": "ظلم"}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "ٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "وَلَٰكِنْ", "translit": "ْnِkَٰlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "أَنفُسَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَsُfnَaʾ", "root": "نفس"}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "يَظْلِمُونَ", "translit": "َnwُmِlْẓَy", "root": "ظلم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 118, "text": "يَٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ لَا تَتَّخِذُوا۟ بِطَانَةً مِّن دُونِكُمْ لَا يَأْلُونَكُمْ خَبَالًا وَدُّوا۟ مَا عَنِتُّمْ قَدْ بَدَتِ ٱلْبَغْضَآءُ مِنْ أَفْوَٰهِهِمْ وَمَا تُخْفِى صُدُورُهُمْ أَكْبَرُۚ قَدْ بَيَّنَّا لَكُمُ ٱلْءَايَٰتِۖ إِن كُنتُمْ تَعْقِلُونَ ", "translation": "O you who have believed, do not take as intimates those other than yourselves [i.e., believers], for they will not spare you [any] ruin. They wish you would have hardship. Hatred has already appeared from their mouths, and what their breasts conceal is greater. We have certainly made clear to you the signs, if you will use reason.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "يَٰٓأَيُّهَا", "translit": "āَhُّyَaʾَٰٓy", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translit": "َnyِhdَّlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ءَامَنُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُnَmāَء", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "لَا", "translit": "āَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "تَتَّخِذُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُhdِhkَّtَt", "root": "اخذ"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "بِطَانَةً", "translit": "ًẗَnāَṭِb", "root": "بطن"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "مِّن", "translit": "nِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "دُونِكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkِnwُd", "root": "دون"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "لَا", "translit": "āَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "يَأْلُونَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَnwُlْaʾَy", "root": "الو"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "خَبَالًا", "translit": "āًlāَbَhk", "root": "خبل"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "وَدُّوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُّdَw", "root": "ودد"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "عَنِتُّمْ", "translit": "ْmُّtِnَʿع", "root": "عنت"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "قَدْ", "translit": "ْdَq", "root": ""}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "بَدَتِ", "translit": "ِtَdَb", "root": "بدو"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "ٱلْبَغْضَآءُ", "translit": "ُءٓāَḍْغَbْlٱ", "root": "بغض"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "مِنْ", "translit": "ْnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "أَفْوَٰهِهِمْ", "translit": "ْmِhِhَٰwْfَaʾ", "root": "فوه"}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "تُخْفِى", "translit": "àِfْhkُt", "root": "خفي"}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "صُدُورُهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhُrwُdُṣ", "root": "صدر"}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "أَكْبَرُ", "translit": "ُrَbْkَaʾ", "root": "كبر"}, {"id": 24, "arabic": "قَدْ", "translit": "ْdَq", "root": ""}, {"id": 25, "arabic": "بَيَّنَّا", "translit": "āَّnَّyَb", "root": "بين"}, {"id": 26, "arabic": "لَكُمُ", "translit": "ُmُkَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 27, "arabic": "ٱلْءَايَٰتِ", "translit": "ِtَٰyāَءْlٱ", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 28, "arabic": "إِن", "translit": "nِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 29, "arabic": "كُنتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtnُk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 30, "arabic": "تَعْقِلُونَ", "translit": "َnwُlِqْʿعَt", "root": "عقل"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 119, "text": "هَٰٓأَنتُمْ أُو۟لَآءِ تُحِبُّونَهُمْ وَلَا يُحِبُّونَكُمْ وَتُؤْمِنُونَ بِٱلْكِتَٰبِ كُلِّهِۦ وَإِذَا لَقُوكُمْ قَالُوٓا۟ ءَامَنَّا وَإِذَا خَلَوْا۟ عَضُّوا۟ عَلَيْكُمُ ٱلْأَنَامِلَ مِنَ ٱلْغَيْظِۚ قُلْ مُوتُوا۟ بِغَيْظِكُمْۗ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ عَلِيمٌۢ بِذَاتِ ٱلصُّدُورِ ", "translation": "Here you are loving them but they are not loving you, while you believe in the Scripture - all of it.[1] And when they meet you, they say, \"We believe.\" But when they are alone, they bite their fingertips at you in rage. Say, \"Die in your rage. Indeed, Allāh is Knowing of that within the breasts.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "هَٰٓأَنتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtnَaʾَٰٓh", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أُو۟لَآءِ", "translit": "ِءٓāَl۟wُaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "تُحِبُّونَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَnwُّbِḥُt", "root": "حبب"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "وَلَا", "translit": "āَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "يُحِبُّونَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَnwُّbِḥُy", "root": "حبب"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "وَتُؤْمِنُونَ", "translit": "َnwُnِmْwʾُtَw", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "بِٱلْكِتَٰبِ", "translit": "ِbَٰtِkْlٱِb", "root": "كتب"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "كُلِّهِۦ", "translit": "ۦِhِّlُk", "root": "كلل"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "وَإِذَا", "translit": "āَhdِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "لَقُوكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkwُqَl", "root": "لقي"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "قَالُوٓا۟", "translit": "۟āٓwُlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "ءَامَنَّا", "translit": "āَّnَmāَء", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "وَإِذَا", "translit": "āَhdِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "خَلَوْا۟", "translit": "۟āْwَlَhk", "root": "خلو"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "عَضُّوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُّḍَʿع", "root": "عضض"}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "عَلَيْكُمُ", "translit": "ُmُkْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "ٱلْأَنَامِلَ", "translit": "َlِmāَnَaʾْlٱ", "root": "نمل"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "ٱلْغَيْظِ", "translit": "ِẓْyَغْlٱ", "root": "غيظ"}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "قُلْ", "translit": "ْlُq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "مُوتُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُtwُm", "root": "موت"}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "بِغَيْظِكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkِẓْyَغِb", "root": "غيظ"}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 24, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 25, "arabic": "عَلِيمٌۢ", "translit": "ٌۢmyِlَʿع", "root": "علم"}, {"id": 26, "arabic": "بِذَاتِ", "translit": "ِtāَhdِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 27, "arabic": "ٱلصُّدُورِ", "translit": "ِrwُdُّṣlٱ", "root": "صدر"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 120, "text": "إِن تَمْسَسْكُمْ حَسَنَةٌ تَسُؤْهُمْ وَإِن تُصِبْكُمْ سَيِّئَةٌ يَفْرَحُوا۟ بِهَاۖ وَإِن تَصْبِرُوا۟ وَتَتَّقُوا۟ لَا يَضُرُّكُمْ كَيْدُهُمْ شَيْـًٔاۗ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ بِمَا يَعْمَلُونَ مُحِيطٌ ", "translation": "If good touches you, it distresses them; but if harm strikes you, they rejoice at it. And if you are patient and fear Allāh, their plot will not harm you at all. Indeed, Allāh is encompassing of what they do.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِن", "translit": "nِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "تَمْسَسْكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkْsَsْmَt", "root": "مسس"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "حَسَنَةٌ", "translit": "ٌẗَnَsَḥ", "root": "حسن"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "تَسُؤْهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhْwʾُsَt", "root": "سوا"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَإِن", "translit": "nِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "تُصِبْكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkْbِṣُt", "root": "صوب"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "سَيِّئَةٌ", "translit": "ٌẗَyʾِّyَs", "root": "سوا"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "يَفْرَحُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُḥَrْfَy", "root": "فرح"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "بِهَا", "translit": "āَhِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "وَإِن", "translit": "nِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "تَصْبِرُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُrِbْṣَt", "root": "صبر"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "وَتَتَّقُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُqَّtَtَw", "root": "وقي"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "لَا", "translit": "āَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "يَضُرُّكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkُّrُḍَy", "root": "ضرر"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "كَيْدُهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhُdْyَk", "root": "كيد"}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "شَيْـًٔا", "translit": "āًٔـْyَhs", "root": "شيا"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "بِمَا", "translit": "āَmِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "يَعْمَلُونَ", "translit": "َnwُlَmْʿعَy", "root": "عمل"}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "مُحِيطٌ", "translit": "ٌṭyِḥُm", "root": "حوط"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 121, "text": "وَإِذْ غَدَوْتَ مِنْ أَهْلِكَ تُبَوِّئُ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ مَقَٰعِدَ لِلْقِتَالِۗ وَٱللَّهُ سَمِيعٌ عَلِيمٌ ", "translation": "And [remember] when you, [O Muḥammad], left your family in the morning to post the believers at their stations for the battle [of Uḥud] - and Allāh is Hearing and Knowing -", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِذْ", "translit": "ْhdِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "غَدَوْتَ", "translit": "َtْwَdَغ", "root": "غدو"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مِنْ", "translit": "ْnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَهْلِكَ", "translit": "َkِlْhَaʾ", "root": "اهل"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "تُبَوِّئُ", "translit": "ُyʾِّwَbُt", "root": "بوا"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ", "translit": "َnyِnِmْwʾُmْlٱ", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "مَقَٰعِدَ", "translit": "َdِʿعَٰqَm", "root": "قعد"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "لِلْقِتَالِ", "translit": "ِlāَtِqْlِl", "root": "قتل"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱَw", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "سَمِيعٌ", "translit": "ٌʿعyِmَs", "root": "سمع"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "عَلِيمٌ", "translit": "ٌmyِlَʿع", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 122, "text": "إِذْ هَمَّت طَّآئِفَتَانِ مِنكُمْ أَن تَفْشَلَا وَٱللَّهُ وَلِيُّهُمَاۗ وَعَلَى ٱللَّهِ فَلْيَتَوَكَّلِ ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ ", "translation": "When two parties among you were about to lose courage, but Allāh was their ally; and upon Allāh the believers should rely.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِذْ", "translit": "ْhdِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "هَمَّت", "translit": "tَّmَh", "root": "همم"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "طَّآئِفَتَانِ", "translit": "ِnāَtَfِyʾٓāَّṭ", "root": "طوف"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مِنكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُknِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "أَن", "translit": "nَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "تَفْشَلَا", "translit": "āَlَhsْfَt", "root": "فشل"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱَw", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "وَلِيُّهُمَا", "translit": "āَmُhُّyِlَw", "root": "ولي"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "وَعَلَى", "translit": "àَlَʿعَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "فَلْيَتَوَكَّلِ", "translit": "ِlَّkَwَtَyْlَf", "root": "وكل"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ", "translit": "َnwُnِmْwʾُmْlٱ", "root": "امن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 123, "text": "وَلَقَدْ نَصَرَكُمُ ٱللَّهُ بِبَدْرٍ وَأَنتُمْ أَذِلَّةٌۖ فَٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ لَعَلَّكُمْ تَشْكُرُونَ ", "translation": "And already had Allāh given you victory at [the battle of] Badr while you were weak [i.e., few in number]. Then fear Allāh; perhaps you will be grateful.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَلَقَدْ", "translit": "ْdَqَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "نَصَرَكُمُ", "translit": "ُmُkَrَṣَn", "root": "نصر"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "بِبَدْرٍ", "translit": "ٍrْdَbِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَأَنتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtnَaʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "أَذِلَّةٌ", "translit": "ٌẗَّlِhdَaʾ", "root": "ذلل"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "فَٱتَّقُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُqَّtٱَf", "root": "وقي"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "لَعَلَّكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَّlَʿعَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "تَشْكُرُونَ", "translit": "َnwُrُkْhsَt", "root": "شكر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 124, "text": "إِذْ تَقُولُ لِلْمُؤْمِنِينَ أَلَن يَكْفِيَكُمْ أَن يُمِدَّكُمْ رَبُّكُم بِثَلَٰثَةِ ءَالَٰفٍ مِّنَ ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةِ مُنزَلِينَ ", "translation": "[Remember] when you said to the believers, \"Is it not sufficient for you that your Lord should reinforce you with three thousand angels sent down?", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِذْ", "translit": "ْhdِiʾ", "